}}

{{QuestInfo|This quest is repeatable.}}

== Walkthrough ==
{{QuestNote|[[Old Rankle]] is located in the Tannery in [[Night Harbor]], in the second floor of a building on the north wall, above the leatherworking trainer.}}
{{Chat|say|Hail, Old Rankle.}}
{{Chat|Old Rankle|Whatcha want, eh? Get outta here. Begone. Scat!}}
{{Emote|Old Rankle cocks his head at you and squints.}}
{{Chat|Old Rankle|Hmm... or did the cappin' send ya for the tails bounty?}}
{{Chat|say|What tails bounty?}}
{{Chat|Old Rankle|That's right! Tails! Ya got some? I love 'em. Make all kinds o' stuff with 'em.}}
{{Chat|say|What kinds of stuff?}}
{{Chat|Old Rankle|That's none o' ya damned business!}}
{{Emote|Old Rankle eyes you suspiciously.}}
{{QuestNote|Based on the surrounding room, it's trivial to guess [[Old Rankle]] is interested in collecting [[Ashira Tail]].}}
{{QuestNote|[[Ashira Tail]] can drop from any Ashira mob.}}
{{QuestNote|Give 1 x [[Ashira Tail]] to [[Old Rankle]].}}
{{Chat|Old Rankle|Tails, tails! More tails, more tails! I’ll take them all. Here’s something for ya.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Tattered Rawhide]] from Old Rankle.}}
{{exp}}
{{Emote|Old Rankle wiggles strangely while pressing the tail to his face.}}
{{Chat|Old Rankle|An' don't worry, I'll tell 'em that you helped me.}}

