|Minimum Level      = 1
|Classes            = All
|Related NPCs       = [[Quartermaster Obaid]];[[an ashira warrior]]
|Quest Rewards      = (exp); [[Tattered Rawhide]]
}}

{{QuestInfo|This quest is repeatable.}}

== Walkthrough ==

{{QuestNote|Watch Captain Badawi wanders all about the upper garrison area of the city.}}
{{Chat|say|Hail, Watch Captain Badawi.}}
{{Chat|Watch Captain Badawi|Well met! Though, I'm not sure what you're doing here. How may I assist you? Have you come to me for the bounty?}}
{{Chat|say|What bounty?}}
{{Chat|Watch Captain Badawi|We've been enlisting the aid of adventurers to purge the ashira threat from our roadways to the west.}}
{{Chat|Watch Captain Badawi|Bring any ashira bracers you find to the garrison's quartermaster, Obaid. He'll reward you for your efforts.}}
<br>
{{QuestNote|[[Quartermaster Obaid]] is located in the Garrison (near west gate) in [[Night Harbor]], in a room adjacent to the area with soldiers hitting training dummies.}}
{{Chat|say|Hail, Quartermaster Obaid.}}
{{Chat|Quartermaster Obaid|Hello there. Do you have a requisition form, or are you here for the bounty?}}
{{Chat|say|What bounty?}}
{{Chat|Quartermaster Obaid|Aye! Watch Captain Badawi issued a bounty on the ashira that have been attacking travelers along the western road. I'm collecting for him.}}
{{Chat|Quartermaster Obaid|Bring me proof in the form of an ashira bracer and I'll see that you get your reward.}}
{{QuestNote|[[Quartermaster Obaid]] is looking for [[Ashira Warrior Bracer]]. These are an uncommon drop from [[an ashira warrior]] and other higher level ashira fighters.}}
{{QuestNote|Give [[Ashira Warrior Bracer]] to [[Quartermaster Obaid]].}}
{{Chat|Quartermaster Obaid|Great work! Another of that furry scourge vanquished. Here’s a little something for your efforts.}}
{{exp}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Tattered Rawhide]] from Quartermaster Obaid.}}
{{Faction|Steel Talons|+}}

