== Walkthrough ==

{{QuestNote|[[Witcher Sayyaad]] is located in the Necropolis found within Night Harbor. Enter the Necropolis from the south entrance with the purple "Concourse of Souls" banner and immediately turn right.}}
{{Chat|say|Hail, Witcher Sayyaad.}}
{{Chat|Witcher &#83;ayyaad|Are you here to slay me?}}
{{Emote|Witcher Sayyadd chuckles.}}
{{Chat|Witcher &#83;ayyaad|I suppose not. Well, you appear pure enough.}}
{{Chat|Witcher &#83;ayyaad|I'm Witcher Sayyaad. I purge the unnatural from this realm. These days it feels like there are monsters around every corner in Night Harbor.}}
{{Chat|say|What monsters?}}
{{Chat|Witcher &#83;ayyaad|A winged terror swoops through the skies at night. We've heard reports of attacks in Saltbreeze Park and other places in the city. Should you encounter this foul beast, slay it and bring me a part of its body as proof.}}
{{QuestNote|Kill [[Night Terror]], a level 8 named bat that spawns only at night in the Necropolis Courtyard and Saltbreeze Park areas of [[Night Harbor]].}}
{{QuestNote|[[Night Terror]] will drop one of three items randomly, which can be returned to [[Witcher Sayyaad]] for a reward.}}

=== [[Mantle of Night]] ===

{{QuestNote|Loot [[Night Terror's Wing]] from [[Night Terror]].}}
{{QuestNote|Return to [[Witcher Sayyadd]] and hand him [[Night Terror's Wing]].}}
