{{exp}}
{{Chat|Witcher &#83;ayyaad|You felled the beast and lived to tell the tale. Well done. Take this for your efforts.}}

=== [[Necklace of Night]] ===

{{QuestNote|Loot [[Night Terror's Head]] from [[Night Terror]].}}
{{QuestNote|Give [[Night Terror's Head]] to [[Witcher Sayyaad]].}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Necklace of Night]] from Witcher Sayyaad.}}
{{exp}}
{{Chat|Witcher &#83;ayyaad|You felled the beast and lived to tell the tale. Well done. Take this for your efforts.}}

