Cinder Beetle Armor Quests.content:
{{HasQuickGuide}}
{{Quest
| imagefilename     = Halfling Cinder Beetle Set.jpg
| width             = 233px
| caption           = Full Cinder Beetle set on Halfling Paladin
|Start Zone         = [[Night Harbor]]
|Quest Giver        = [[Hult Beetlewrangler]]
|Minimum Level      = 14
|Classes            = ARC BRD BST CLR DRU FTR INQ MNK PAL RNG ROG SHD SHM SPB
|Related NPCs       = 
[[a master blacksmith]]
[[Weaponsmith Sielah Zefir]]
[[Shipwright Benlink]]
[[Master Shipwright Huda]]
| Quest Rewards =
[[Cinder Beetle Shield]]
[[Cinder Beetle Boots]]
[[Cinder Beetle Helm]]
