[[Cinder Beetle Breastplate]] 
}}

==Shopping List==
{{Checklist|title=Full set:|
* 7x [[Cinder Beetle Legs]]
* 11x [[Cinder Beetle Carapace]]
* 1x [[Cinder Beetle Mandible]]
* 1x [[Cinder Beetle Gland]]
* 3x [[Cinder Beetle Blood]]
* 1x [[Giant Cinder Beetle Eye]]
* 3x [[Cinder Beetle Serrated Mandible]]
* 2x [[Charcoal]]
* 1x [[Copper Dagger]]
* 1x [[Crude Fish Oil]]
* 1x [[Twilight Bay Rum]]
* 2x [[Resin]]
}}
== Walkthrough ==
As a general tip, you can often find [[Cinder Beetle Carapace]], [[Cinder Beetle Legs]], and [[Cinder Beetle Gland]] for sale on the Blacksmith and Cook vendors across Night Harbor.

===[[Cinder Beetle Shield]]===
----
{{Checklist|title=Shield:|
* 1x [[Cinder Beetle Legs]]
* 1x [[Cinder Beetle Carapace]]
}}
----
{{QuestNote|Knowing Hult Beetlewrangler is a master craftsman of fine beetle parts, you inquire about crafting armor from cinder beetle shells you've encountered during your travels.}}
{{Chat|say|Hail, Hult Beetlewrangler}}
{{Chat|Hult Beetlewrangler|Woah, ho there, adventurer. Ya lookin for work or wares? No matter, ol' Hult's got somethin for ya either way.}}
{{Chat|say|Can you make anything with cinder beetle parts?}}
{{Chat|Hult Beetlewrangler|Cinder beetles, boss? Ol' Hult's never had the opportunity to try his handiwork with one of them beetle shells.}}
{{Chat|Hult Beetlewrangler|Tell ya what, hand me one of 'em cinder beetle shells and a cinder beetle leg and we'll see what ol' Hult can do with 'em.}}
{{QuestNote|Give Hult Beetlewrangler 1 x [[Cinder Beetle Carapace]] and 1 x [[Cinder Beetle Legs]]}}
{{Emote|Hult Beetlewrangler takes the carapace and legs and begins to work on them.}}
{{Chat|Hult Beetlewrangler|Well, this is gonna... oh no.}}
{{Chat|Hult Beetlewrangler|No wait, I can make this work. Hold yer camels. Just need ya to be a little more patient.}}
{{Chat|Hult Beetlewrangler|There we go. All done.}}
{{Chat|Hult Beetlewrangler|I'm afraid this is the limit of my beetle craftin' skills. If ya got more cinder parts to spare, ya might want to try the master blacksmith in the Night Market.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Cinder Beetle Shield]] from [[Hult Beetlewrangler]].}}
{{QuestNote|[[Hult Beetlewrangler]] recommends you speak to [[a master blacksmith]].}}

===[[Cinder Beetle Boots]]===
----
{{Checklist|title=Boots:|
* 2x [[Cinder Beetle Legs]]
* 1x [[Cinder Beetle Carapace]]
}}
----
{{QuestNote|The master blacksmith only works at night (spawns at 6 PM in-game time). He is located in front of the Blacksmithing building in the Night Market.}}
{{Chat|say|Hult mentioned you could craft armor with cinder beetle parts?}}
{{Chat|a master blacksmith|Cinder beetles? You must've been talking to ol' Hult.}}
{{Chat|a master blacksmith|There was a time when Hult and I used to make a few armor pieces from whatever was on hand, back when the iron supply was low. Cinder beetle armor was one of those.}}
{{Chat|a master blacksmith|If you bring me a cinder beetle carapace and two beetle legs, I might be able to put together a nice pair of boots for you. No promises though.}}
{{QuestNote|Give [[a master blacksmith]] 1 x [[Cinder Beetle Carapace]] and 2 x [[Cinder Beetle Legs]]}}
{{Chat|a master blacksmith|Well I did say I'd give it a go, didn't I?}}
{{Emote|a master blacksmith breaks the carapace in half and rounds it out, his skilled hands shaping it masterfully.}}
{{Chat|a master blacksmith|Seems I've still got it. Here you go. These boots should keep you warm on cold nights in the desert.}}
{{Chat|a master blacksmith|If you're ever interested in more cinder armor pieces, let me know. Smiths from all over Night Harbor come by all the time. They might share recipes they've picked up out in the wild.}}
{{exp}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Cinder Beetle Boots]] from [[a master blacksmith]].}}
{{QuestNote|You can inquire if any recipes have been shared with [[a master blacksmith]] recently to continue the quest.}}
{{Chat|say|Have any other blacksmiths shared their recipes with you?}}
{{Chat|a master blacksmith|Since you're so eager, you should go see Sielah Zefir in the Black Feather Bazaar.}}
{{Chat|a master blacksmith|A while back, he mentioned that he tried to make a helm once.}}
{{Chat|a master blacksmith|...He didn't say if he was successful or not, though.}}

===[[Cinder Beetle Helm]]===
----
{{Checklist|title=Helm:|
* 2x [[Cinder Beetle Carapace]]
* 2x [[Cinder Beetle Legs]]
* 2x [[Charcoal]]
* 1x [[Copper Dagger]]
* 1x [[Cinder Beetle Mandible]]
}}
----
{{QuestNote|[[Weaponsmith Sielah Zefir]] is located in the Black Feather Bazaar.}}
{{Chat|say|A master blacksmith mentioned you tried to make a cinder beetle helm?}}
{{Chat|Weaponsmith Sielah Zefir|Interested in cinder beetle armor, eh?}}
{{Chat|Weaponsmith Sielah Zefir|Yes, I once had a helm that I fashioned from cinder beetle pieces.}}
{{Chat|Weaponsmith Sielah Zefir|I sold it some time ago to one of the watchmen. I could make you one if you have the pieces I need.}}
{{Chat|say|What pieces do you need?}}
{{Chat|Weaponsmith Sielah Zefir|If my memory serves me right, I'll need two cinder beetle carapaces, two cinder beetle legs, and a cinder beetle mandible.}}
{{Chat|Weaponsmith Sielah Zefir|Be careful handling the mandibles. The serrated sort are especially nasty... I prefer not to use those.}}
{{Chat|Weaponsmith Sielah Zefir|On top of the beetle parts, I'll need two extra pieces of charcoal for the helm. Cinder shells are fire-resistant and hard to work with, so my forge will need to be blazing hot for this to work.}}
{{Chat|Weaponsmith Sielah Zefir|Those are just the materials for construction... now, let's talk payment.}}
{{Chat|Weaponsmith Sielah Zefir|How about you throw in a copper dagger to make it worth my trouble, Deal?}}
{{QuestNote|The [[Cinder Beetle Mandible]] is a rare drop off [[a cinder drone]] in [[Sungreet Strand]].}}
{{QuestNote|You can either craft a [[Copper Dagger]] or sometimes find them on weapon vendors across [[Night Harbor]].}}
{{QuestNote|[[Charcoal]] can be purchased from various goods merchants across [[Night Harbor]].}}
{{QuestNote|Hand [[Weaponsmith Sielah Zefir]] 2 x [[Cinder Beetle Carapace]], 2 x [[Cinder Beetle Legs]], 2 x [[Charcoal]], 1 x [[Copper Dagger]], and 1 x [[Cinder Beetle Mandible]].}}
{{exp}}
{{Chat|Weaponsmith Sielah Zefir|These will do the trick. Now to fire these embers up, hotter than a basilisk's temper!}}
{{Emote|Weaponsmith Sielah Zefir begins working the beetle parts with his hammer, shaping the carapace into a squat helm reinforced with mandible guards and ornamental horns.}}
{{Emote|Weaponsmith Sielah Zefir smiles, admiring his handiwork.}}
{{Chat|Weaponsmith Sielah Zefir|It seems I still have the talent for beetle wrangling! Here you go.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Cinder Beetle Boots]] from [[Weaponsmith Sielah Zefir]].}}
{{Chat|Weaponsmith Sielah Zefir|If you're looking for more armor, I heard the naval boys down at the Steel Talons Garrison are keen on heat-resistant armors to wear out to sea. You could inquire with their shipwright, if you've a mind for it.}}
{{Chat|Weaponsmith Sielah Zefir|Oh, I almost forgot the dagger. This..."}}
{{Emote|Weaponsmith Sielah Zefir flips the dagger quickly in his hand. It flashes in the light for a moment, then disappears within the folds of his clothing, out of sight.}}
{{Chat|Weaponsmith Sielah Zefir|...is exactly what I needed, and you came through for me. Let me give you something extra in return.}}
{{Chat|Weaponsmith Sielah Zefir|These were found out in the desolation of scale and sword by a Pyrmos mercenary. The ogre said he got an uneasy feeling holding them and decided to leave them here... they seem fine to me, though.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Black Feather Arrow]] from [[Weaponsmith Sielah Zefir]].}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Black Feather Arrow]] from [[Weaponsmith Sielah Zefir]].}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Black Feather Arrow]] from [[Weaponsmith Sielah Zefir]].}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Black Feather Arrow]] from [[Weaponsmith Sielah Zefir]].}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Black Feather Arrow]] from [[Weaponsmith Sielah Zefir]].}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Black Feather Arrow]] from [[Weaponsmith Sielah Zefir]].}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Black Feather Arrow]] from [[Weaponsmith Sielah Zefir]].}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Black Feather Arrow]] from [[Weaponsmith Sielah Zefir]].}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Black Feather Arrow]] from [[Weaponsmith Sielah Zefir]].}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Black Feather Arrow]] from [[Weaponsmith Sielah Zefir]].}}
{{Chat|Weaponsmith Sielah Zefir|The fletching is raven feather and the broadhead is sharpened bone. Possibly the teeth of some creature... maybe a shark. Anyway, I hope you can make good use of them!}}
{{QuestInfo|It is uncertain if [[Black Feather Arrow]] has a further purpose in another quest chain. More information is required.}}

===[[Cinder Beetle Greaves]]===
----
{{Checklist|title=Greaves:|
* 1x [[Cinder Beetle Gland]]
* 1x [[Cinder Beetle Blood]]
* 3x [[Cinder Beetle Carapace]]
* 2x [[Cinder Beetle Legs]]
* 1x [[Cinder Beetle Serrated Mandible]]
}}
----
{{QuestNote|[[Shipwright Benlink]] is located behind some crates on the docks in Southwest Night Harbor during the day (located near "a first mate" and "a sailor").}}
{{Chat|say|Do you know anything about cinder beetles?}}
{{Chat|Shipwright Benlink|Cinder beetles from out in the quarry? I've actually happened upon a method to fashion some formidable greaves from their tough hides.}}
{{Chat|Shipwright Benlink|Their carapaces even block Eth's rays when you can't escape her, like out on the high seas.}}
{{Chat|say|Would you fashion a pair of greaves for me?}}
{{Chat|Shipwright Benlink|I suppose I could spare a moment to craft you some, so long as you're able to get me the parts required.}}
{{Chat|Shipwright Benlink|I'll need three cinder beetle carapaces, two cinder beetle legs, and a mandible... a serrated one. I'll also require a special tanning agent.}}
{{Chat|say|Can you tell me about the special tanning agent?}}
{{Chat|Shipwright Benlink|Despite looking like metal, I've always found that cinder carapaces mold better if they're treated like hardened leather.}} 
{{Chat|Shipwright Benlink|[[Dilshad Abolfazl]] at the tannery could mix up a tanning agent for you if you bring him a cinder beetle gland and some cinder blood.}}
{{QuestNote|Visit [[Dilshad Abolfazl]], who is located at the Tannery in Night Harbor near the West Gate Bank. Hand him 1 x [[Cinder Beetle Gland]] and 1 x [[Cinder Beetle Blood]].}}
{{Chat|Dilshad Abolfazl|What's this? Heh, the last time Benlink had me make some of this was when I owed him from my gambling debts... though if you're bringing the parts, I suppose there's no harm. One moment.}}
{{Emote|Dilshad Abolfazl mixes the gland and blood with a fine powder, producing an oily liquid with a bright orange hue.}}
{{Chat|Dilshad Abolfazl|Here you are. Let Benlink know that fortune's going to smile upon me during our next game!}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Cinder Tanning Agent]] from [[Dilshad Abolfazl]].}}
{{QuestNote|Give [[Shipwright Benlink]] 3 x [[Cinder Beetle Carapace]], 2 x [[Cinder Beetle Legs]], 1 x [[Cinder Beetle Serrated Mandible]], and 1 x [[Cinder Tanning Agent]].}}
{{Emote|Shipwright Benlink takes the parts and wastes no time getting to work.}}
{{Emote|Shipwright Benlink heats the resistant carapaces and forms them into plates, stretching the mandible to create a waistline of sorts. He weaves the legs between each plate to hold them together, then coats them in a tanning agent, which draws out their color and gives them a fine sheen.}}
{{Chat|Shipwright Benlink|There you are, one pair of cinder beetle greaves! I always enjoy working with this stuff, though, not as much as Huda. They say he could make an entire ship out of beetle shells!}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Cinder Beetle Greaves]] from [[Shipwright Benlink]].}}

===[[Cinder Beetle Breastplate]]===
----
{{Checklist|title=Breastplate:|
* 2x [[Resin]]
* 2x [[Cinder Beetle Blood]]
* 1x [[Crude Fish Oil]]
* 1x [[Twilight Bay Rum]]
* 4x [[Cinder Beetle Carapace]]
* 2x [[Cinder Beetle Serrated Mandible]]
* 1x [[Giant Cinder Beetle Eye]]
}}
----
{{QuestNote|Seek out [[Master Shipwright Huda]] in the Night Harbor docks. He is located just south of the Teleporter to Sageside standing next to the hull of a ship, near the [[Carpentry Trainer]].}}
{{Chat|say|Hail, Master Shipwright Huda.}}
{{Chat|Master Shipwright Huda|Fair winds to you, traveler. A great day for a sail at sea, don't you think?}}
{{Chat|say|Do you know anything about cinder beetles?}}
{{Chat|Master Shipwright Huda|Cinder beetles? Why, yes, of course! Ever since I was a young boy, I'd use beetle carapaces as makeshift toy boats and float them out on the harbor.}}
{{Chat|Master Shipwright Huda|I always dreamed of making a full-sized craft out of their shells... but I could never find one large enough. I did manage to make an impressive breastplate, at least.}}
{{Chat|say|Can you make me a breastplate?}}
{{Chat|Master Shipwright Huda|Ah, that caught your attention, did it? Well, I suppose I could craft you one if you sought out all the proper pieces.}}
{{Chat|Master Shipwright Huda|For the breastplate, I'd need four cinder beetle carapaces, two of their serrated mandibles, a giant cinder beetle eye, as well as a special varnish.}}
{{Chat|say|What is the special varnish?}}
{{Emote|Master Shipwright Huda leans in close and whispers.}}
{{Chat|Master Shipwright Huda|Most people try to work the shells like steel, when really they're more like the wood of a ship!}}
{{Chat|Master Shipwright Huda|For that reason, I use a varnish that's made up of two parts resin, two parts cinder blood, one part fish oil, and some Twilight Bay rum!}}
{{Chat|Master Shipwright Huda|Old Hult at the Sojourner camp knows how to make the varnish. Just bring him the proper ingredients.}}
{{QuestNote|Make a trip to [[Hult Beetlewrangler]] and hand him 2 x [[Resin]], 2 x [[Cinder Beetle Blood]], 1 x [[Crude Fish Oil]], and 1 x [[Twilight Bay Rum]].}}
{{Chat|Hult Beetlewrangler|It's been an age since I made any o' this for Huda! He's the reason I made my first bowl, he is. Gonna make his own ship one day, and ol' Hult is gonna cross the sea on a beetle's back!}}
{{Emote|Hult Beetlewrangler proceeds to mix the resin, oil, and cinder blood together to form a rich and dark varnish. He guzzles down the rum and lets out a loud belch.}}
{{Chat|Hult Beetlewrangler|Oof, that hits the spot! Thanks for the rum, boss. You tell Huda that his brother's makin' a big name for himself out here wit' the locals!}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Cinder Varnish]] from [[Hult Beetlewrangler]].}}
{{QuestNote|Hand [[Master Shipwright Huda]] 4 x [[Cinder Beetle Carapace]], 2 x [[Cinder Beetle Serrated Mandible]], 1 x [[Giant Cinder Beetle Eye]], and 1 x [[Cinder Varnish]].}}
{{Chat|Master Shipwright Huda|You've gone and done it... wonderful! I'll get right to work.}}
{{Chat|Master Shipwright Huda|This shouldn't take long. In fact, I've been looking forward to your return!}}
{{Emote|Master Shipwright Huda handles the carapaces masterfully, shaping them into protective plates and adorning the eye at the center of the chest. He coats the breastplate with varnish, and the color immediately pops, shining brighter than before.}}
{{Chat|Master Shipwright Huda|Here you are, friend. A fine piece, if I do say so myself. Thank you for allowing me to hone my skills. It's been far too long since I last dreamt of beetles.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Cinder Beetle Breastplate]] from [[Master Shipwright Huda]].}}

