* Faction gained with [[Preservers]]

{{QuestInfo|This quest is repeatable.}}

== Walkthrough ==

{{QuestNote|[[Moon Dances]] is located near the Shaman Spell Merchant at The Balanced Branch, which is only reachable from the Ranger/Beastmaster Platform.}}
{{Chat|say|Hail, Moon Dances.}}
{{Emote|Moon Dances offers you a serene bow.}}
{{Chat|Moon Dances|I greet you. I am called Moon Dances, though I am afraid that my namesake is not so true these past nights.}}
{{Chat|say|What namesake?}}
{{Chat|Moon Dances|I would often dance along with the songs of the spirits during the moonlight. Lately, however, the nights are filled with anguished cries instead of song.}}
{{Chat|Moon Dances|The spirits of the Weald are distraught... Frightened even.}}
{{Chat|say|Why are they distraught?}}
{{Chat|Moon Dances|Unnatural things have been called upon in the Weald. Undead now roam the forest floor, and their very presence upsets the balance.}}
{{Chat|Moon Dances|Would you help me in bringing an end to these creatures most foul?}}
{{Chat|say|I will help.}}
{{Emote|Moon Dances offers you a bow once more, this one out of gratitude.}}
{{Chat|Moon Dances|I will perform a rite of cleansing to put the spirits of the fallen to rest, should you bring me enough of their remains.}}
{{Chat|Moon Dances|I can part with some small tokens of appreciation for every five bone chips you bring me.}}
{{QuestNote|Find and hunt skeleton mobs such as [[a rotting skeleton]] in [[Evershade Weald]]. You can often times find [[Bone Chips]] on vendors in [[Faelindral]] as well.}}
{{QuestNote|Give 5 x [[Bone Chips]] to [[Moon Dances]].}}
{{Chat|Moon Dances|Thank you for purging the land of another undead menace. I'll dispose of these remains.}}
{{exp}}
{{Faction|Preservers|+}}
{{Emote|Moon Dances accepts the offered bone chips and stores them safely away.}}
{{Chat|Moon Dances|You have my humble thanks. I shall see to performing the rite, so that these fallen spirits are put to proper rest.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Tattered Cloth]] from Moon Dances.}}

