Culling the Fellstone.content:
{{Quest
| imagefilename     = Wyrdguard Oakenpine.png

| width             = 500px
| caption           = Quest giver Wyrdguard Oakenpine
|Start Zone         = [[Faelindral]]
|Quest Giver        = [[Wyrdguard Oakenpine]]
|Minimum Level      = 1
