|Quest Rewards      = [[Tattered Rawhide]]; (exp);
}}

* Faction increase with [[Wyrdguard]]
* Faction increase with [[Ardent Keepers]]
* Faction loss with [[Fellstone Orcs]]

{{QuestInfo|This quest is repeatable.}}

== Walkthrough ==

{{QuestNote|Seek out [[Wyrdguard Oakenpine]], who is located across the bridge from the Tanner building in [[Faelindral]].}}
{{Chat|say|Hail, Wyrdguard Oakenpine.}}
{{Emote|Wyrdguard Oakenpine offers a firm nod as he greets you.}}
{{Chat|Wyrdguard Oakenpine|Well met, <class>. Be cautious should you choose to venture into the southeastern cliffs of the Weald. There have been more and more reports of orc sightings as of late.}}
{{Chat|say|What orcs?}}
{{Chat|Wyrdguard Oakenpine|Their entry into the Weald remains a mystery, as both the Wyrdguard and Keepers work to combat the incursion.}}
{{Chat|Wyrdguard Oakenpine|I am prepared to offer a bounty to any who would aid in the culling of the Fellstone ranks. I will provide some spare gear from the garrison in exchange for any orcish left ear that is brought to me.}}
{{Chat|say|What bounty?}}
{{Chat|Wyrdguard Oakenpine|If you are interested in the bounty, you will be rewarded for every left ear you bring me.}}
{{Chat|Wyrdguard Oakenpine|Do not waste your effort on the smaller scouts, as they are no true threat. The Fellstone warriors and above are to be your quarry.}}
{{QuestNote|You can find Fellstone orcs all over [[Evershade Weald]]. The most common early level variant is [[A Fellstone warrior]]. Kill several orcs until you have one or more [[Left Orc Ear]].}}
{{QuestNote|Hand in 1 x [[Left Orc Ear]] to [[Wyrdguard Oakenpine]].}}
{{Emote|Wyrdguard Oakenpine accepts the grisly token with a smug smile and a nod of satisfaction.}}
{{Chat|Wyrdguard Oakenpine|Another bounty claimed, well done. Would that I could see their entire blighted presence purged from the beauty of Evershade. Here is your reward.}}
{{QuestInfo|The above sentence is accurate in-game as of 2026-10-01.}}
{{exp}}
{{Faction|Wyrdguard|+}}
{{Faction|Ardent Keepers|+}}
{{Faction|Fellstone Orcs|-}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Tattered Rawhide]] from Wyrdguard Oakenpine.}}

