== Walkthrough ==
{{QuestNote|[[Researcher Fairgrove]] is located slightly above the bank (just a few meters) in the Heartwood Archives. Take the ramp just outside of the bank and use the platform that wraps around the other side of the tree.}}
{{Chat|say|Hail, Researcher Fairgrove.}}
{{Emote|Researcher Fairgrove seems to be heavily engrossed with a thick tome of ancient leafpress. She acknowledges you with a nervous stutter.}}
{{Chat|Researcher Fairgrove|Ah, h-hello, yes. You'll have to e-excuse me, I'm terribly busy with all these... w-writings!}}
{{Chat|say|What writings?}}
{{Chat|Researcher Fairgrove|O-oh yes, have you not heard? Fellstone scouts have been spotted roaming the Weald and... and w-writing things!}}
{{Chat|Researcher Fairgrove|T-terrible things, no doubt. I'm doing what I can to a-aid the Wyrdguard by attempting to d-decipher their script, but it's so... s-so very ''alien''.}}
{{Chat|Researcher Fairgrove|B-be that as it may, I w-would... still greatly appreciate any additional writings of theirs to study, should you happen to come a-across them in your journeys.}}
{{QuestNote|Collect [[Unintelligible Writings]] from [[a Fellstone scout]] in [[Evershade Weald]], then hand them in one at a time to [[Researcher Fairgrove]].}}
{{Chat|Researcher Fairgrove|T-thank you very much for your assistance! The m-more of these writings I can study, the... the closer I believe I am to uncovering their meanings.}}
{{Chat|Researcher Fairgrove|It i-isn't much, but here is a little something for going o-out of your way for me.}}
{{exp}}
{{faction|Defenders of Faelindral|+}}
{{faction|Citizens of Faelindral|+}}
{{faction|Fellstone Orcs|-}}
