Dispose of the Onyx Outlaws.content:
{{NeedsInfo}}
{{Quest
| imagefilename     = phicon.png
| width             = 100px
| caption           = Placeholder Image
|Start Zone         = [[Sungreet Strand]]
|Quest Giver        = [[Foreman Stonehammer]]
|Minimum Level      = 1
|Classes            = All
|Related NPCs       = [[Taskmaster Feeka]], [[Taskmaster Gitch]], [[Taskmaster Urka]]
|Quest Rewards      = (exp); (money:0,0,10,0); [[Stone Sack]]; [[Stonehammer Maul]]
}}

Upon killing a Taskmaster or Overseer, you will GAIN faction standing with Congregation of Trem, and LOSE faction standing with Onyx Outlaw Gang.
Upon quest completion, you will GAIN faction standing with Congregation of Trem.

== Walkthrough ==

{{QuestInfo|Initial hail conversations and breadcrumbs are missing here.}}
{{QuestNote|Kill all three taskmasters from the Quarry below [[Foreman Stonehammer]].}}
{{QuestNote|Each taskmaster will drop a whip. When all three whips are collected, they can be handed in to [[Foreman Stonehammer]].}}
{{Checklist|title=Kill the Taskmasters!|
* Kill [[Taskmaster Feeka]] and Loot [[Feeka's Whip]].
* Kill [[Taskmaster Gitch]] and Loot [[Gitch's Whip]].
* Kill [[Taskmaster Urka]] and Loot [[Urka's Whip]].
}}
{{QuestNote|Return to [[Foreman Stonehammer]] and hand him [[Feeka's Whip]], [[Gitch's Whip]], and [[Urka's Whip]].}}
{{Chat|Foreman Stonehammer|By Trem's golden beard, you've done it! Good on ya! May their coffers be ever empty!}}
{{Chat|Foreman Stonehammer|Here, take this as payment. Trem favors the fortunate.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Stone Sack]] from Foreman Stonehammer.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive 10 silver from Foreman Stonehammer.}}
{{QuestInfo|Faction hits?}}
{{Chat|Foreman Stonehammer|I've been watchin' them from the ridge. I now know who's leadin' their operations.  If you've still got the strength left, we can put them outta business for good.}}
{{Chat|say|I've got the strength.}}
{{Chat|Foreman Stonehammer|It's a fortunate thing that our paths crossed. Trem despises unfinished work, and we ought t' see this through to the end.}}
{{Emote|Foreman Stonehammer points out toward the middle of the quarry.}}
{{Chat|Foreman Stonehammer|Up there, at the summit, is the Onyx Outlaw camp.  I've seen the one they all fear... their overseer.}}
{{Chat|Foreman Stonehammer|No one dares look him in the eye.  He's the one holding power over 'em all.  He's the one we need to take down.}}
{{Chat|Foreman Stonehammer|While you were dealin' with the taskmasters, I saw the overseer send out a messenger.  Whatever his message was, it's irrelevant.  What matters is our message.}}
{{Chat|Foreman Stonehammer|Go to the summit.  Kill the overseer.  Bring me his head, and I'll make sure it's disposed of.}}
{{Chat|Foreman Stonehammer|When his little friends arrive and see what's befallen their operation, they'll know they're not welcome here, and the rest of the hang will scatter to the winds..}}
{{QuestNote|Find [[a goblin overseer]] on the top of the tallest pillar, and kill him.}}
{{QuestNote|Loot the [[Head of the Overseer]] from [[a goblin overseer]].}}
{{QuestNote|Return to [[Foreman Stonehammer]] and hand him [[Head of the Overseer]].}}
{{Chat|Foreman Stonehammer|Priase the gods!  Trem's heavy purse clinks loudly this day!}}
{{Chat|Foreman Stonehammer|I'm sure the Onyx Outlaws will know it wasn't personal, it's just business.}}
{{Chat|Foreman Stonehammer|With the overseer gone, the others won't be far behind.  Take this, and know you've done a great deed for the Church of Trem.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Stonehammer Maul]] from Foreman Stonehammer.}}
{{QuestInfo|Your faction standing with Congregation of Trem got Better}}
{{QuestInfo|Small blue bump in XP at 22}}
{{QuestInfo|Earlier in the dialogue, the Foreman mentions the overseer sending out a messenger. Perhaps the Onyx Outlaws storyline continues elsewhere...?}}

