|Quest Rewards      = [[Chompers Hide Tunic]]
}}

== Walkthrough ==

{{QuestNote|[[Cheikho]] is at the hunters camp on the eastern side of the large, rocky mound separating the smuggler area from the oasis with the ghouls. You can see the camp from the beach.}}
{{Chat|say|Hail, Cheikho.}}
{{Chat|Cheikho|Hail to you, friend!}}
{{Chat|Cheikho|We're hunting the nearby beach for crocodiles. If you have meat or skins for us, we're happy to purchase them. We also have some goods for sale. Take a look!}}
{{Chat|say|You are hunting crocodiles?}}
{{Chat|Cheikho|Yes, down along the shoreline. But take care... this area has more dangers than just the crocodiles.}}
{{Chat|say|More dangers?}}
{{Chat|Cheikho|Look around friend! How did you make it this far without dying?}}
{{Emote|Cheikho laughs.}}
{{Chat|Cheikho|There's undead just over the dunes to the northeast, smugglers to our west, and giant scouts prowling around at night... and to top it all off, there's a particularly large and hostile croc wandering about named Chompers.}}
{{Chat|Cheikho|You'd best take care when running around here.}}
{{Chat|say|Who is Chompers?}}
{{Chat|Cheikho|Yeah, Chompers. Nasty feller. I bet his hide would make one heck of a tunic, though.}}
{{QuestNote|[[Chompers]] is a level 16 crocodile which will spawn randomly along the beach.}}
{{QuestNote|Kill [[Chompers]] and loot [[Chomper's Hide]].}}
{{QuestNote|Return to [[Cheikho]] and give him 1 x [[Chomper's Hide]].}}
{{Chat|Cheikho|Incredible work, friend! You've slain the beast! Here, let me fashion that tunic for you.}}
{{exp}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Chompers Hide Tunic|Chompers' Hide Tunic]] from Cheikho.}}

