A Sweet Treat.content:
{{NeedsInfo}}
{{HasQuickGuide}}
{{Quest
| name          = 
| Quest Giver   = [[Guard Pippi Pinecone]]
| Start Zone    = [[Evershade Weald]]
| Related NPCs  = [[Mierra Willowshade]]; [[a wasp drone]]; [[Guard Halfsies]]; [[Chef Violyn]]
| Related Items = [[Jelly Cupcake]], 1; [[Royal Jelly]], 12; [[Satchel]], 1; [[Packaged Cupcakes]], 1; [[Violyn's Grocery Basket]], 1; [[Violyn's Grocery List]], 1; [[Dried Dragon's Breath Pepper]], 2; [[Baladi]], 1; [[Basilisk Seasoning]], 4; [[Viper's Kick]], 2; [[Violyn's Full Grocery Basket]], 1; [[Violyn's Special Batch of Cupcakes]], 1; [[Half of Violyn's Cupcake]], 1
| imagefilename = Jelly Cupcake.png
| width         = 100px
| caption       = A Jelly Cupcake
| Minimum Level = 1
| Classes       = ALL
| Races         = ALL
| Quest Rewards = [[Stein of Baker's Scorn]], 1; [[Half of a Jelly Cupcake]], 1; (exp); (money: 55S)
}}

== Walkthrough ==
{{QuestInfo|Guard Pippi Pinecone has ambient dialogue that clues the observant player on how to initiate this quest.}}

=== The Hungry Guard ===
{{Emote|Guard Pippi Pinecone places a hand over her stomach.}}
{{Chat|Guard Pippi Pinecone|I'm famished! What I wouldn't do for a sweet treat right about now.}}
{{QuestNote|Give Guard Pippi Pinecone 1 x [[Jelly Cupcake]], which you can obtain from completing [[Mierra's Famed Cupcakes]].}}

{{exp}}
{{Faction|Defenders of Faelindral|+}}
{{Chat|Guard Pippi Pinecone|Oh, for me? You shouldn't have!}}
{{Emote|Guard Pippi Pinecone proceeds to devour the cupcake in a two-bite display, then lets out a satisfied huff and pats her stomach.}}
{{Chat|Guard Pippi Pinecone|Such decadence! Thank you, my friend. I'll never not enjoy one of Mierra's cupcakes. It makes my brother so jealous that I'm able to indulge in such confectionery!}}
{{Chat|say|Your brother?}}
{{Chat|Guard Pippi Pinecone|Oh yes, I have a brother posted in the smallfolk district of Night Harbor, far from the Weald. Do you think that you'll be traveling that way any time soon?}}
{{Chat|Guard Pippi Pinecone|You see, my brother always complains that there's nothing sweet for him to eat in Szuur. I've always wanted to send my brother a full dozen of Mierra's beautiful cupcakes as a tease- I mean a gift!}}
{{Emote|Guard Pippi Pinecone pauses.}}
{{Chat|Guard Pippi Pinecone|Mostly a gift.}}
{{Chat|Guard Pippi Pinecone|Could you ask Mierra to pack up a dozen for me? Then, if you bring the packed cupcakes to me, I'll write a note telling my brother to compensate you for playing the part of the courier.}}
{{QuestNote|Head to [[Mierra Willowshade]] near the inn.}}
{{Chat|say|Could you pack up a dozen of the jelly cupcakes?}}
{{Chat|Mierra Willowshade|A whole dozen?! Sleepers rest, I suppose I could... though you'd still have to provide me with the royal jelly I require for the batch.}}
{{Chat|Mierra Willowshade|Not to mention the packaging... hmm. If you bring me twelve royal jelly and a satchel from the bag vendor, I should be able to pack everything up for you.}}
{{QuestNote|Bring 12 x [[Royal Jelly]] and 1 x [[Satchel]] to Mierra Willowshade.}}
{{exp}}
{{Faction|Citizens of Faelindral|+}}
{{Chat|Mierra Willowshade|I'm impressed that you found so much! Did you locate a secret hive? Hmm, hmm. You might just have to become my main supplier!}}
{{Chat|Mierra Willowshade|Regardless, let me get this dozen baked perfectly for you!}}
{{Emote|Mierra Willowshade hums a tune as she sets to work preparing a dozen freshly baked jelly cupcakes. A familiar aroma fills the kitchen as she carefully packages the cupcakes into the satchel and returns it to you.}}
{{Chat|Mierra Willowshade|Here you are, my friend. I must say, you're probably the biggest fan of my cupcakes! Thank you once again for your business.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Packaged Cupcakes]] from Mierra Willowshade.}}
{{QuestNote|Deliver 1 x [[Packaged Cupcakes]] to Guard Pippi Pinecone.}}
{{exp}}
{{Chat|Guard Pippi Pinecone|Oh, how wonderful! I'm very tempted to keep these cupcakes for myself, but I could never spoil the effort you went through to get these!}}
{{Chat|Guard Pippi Pinecone|My brother should compensate you well for your travel time as he earns a guard's wage in Night Harbor.}}
{{Emote|Guard Pippi Pinecone attaches a small note to the package and returns it to you.}}
{{Chat|Guard Pippi Pinecone|Pete Pinecone is his name. Thank you for doing this for me, friend!}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Packaged Cupcakes]] from Guard Pippi Pinecone.}}

=== Delivery ===
{{QuestNote|Travel to the Smallfolk District, south of Saltbreeze Park, in [[Night Harbor]] and search for [[Guard Halfsies]]. You can ask other guards in the area about Pete Pinecone as well.}}
{{Chat|say|Hail, Guard Greenbiar.}}
{{Chat|Guard Greenbiar|Greetings! Please mind your manners in the smallfolk district. We like to keep things peaceful here.}}
{{Chat|say|Do you know Pete Pinecone?}}
{{Chat|Guard Greenbiar|Pete? I'm afraid I don't know a Pete, nor do we have any pinecones in the desert! Sorry I can't help you, friend.}}
{{Chat|say|Hail, Guard Leafla.}}
{{Chat|Guard Leafla|A fair day to you, friend.}}
{{Chat|Say|Do you know Pete Pinecone?}}
{{Chat|Guard Leafla|Pete? Pete Pinecone? Oh! You must be looking for Guard Halfsies. That's what everyone calls him here, since he's half the guard that the rest of us are.}}
{{Chat|say|Hail, Guard Halfsies.}}
{{Chat|Guard Halfsies|Never you fear when Guard Halfsies is near! I'll kick evil-doers right in their rear!}}
{{Chat|say|Do you know a Pete Pinecone?}}
{{Chat|Guard Halfsies|That's me, Pete Pinecone! Though I go by Guard Halfsies around here. Not on account of my size, but due to how generously I share half of my shift with my fellow guards!}}
{{QuestNote|Hand the [[Packaged Cupcakes]] to Guard Halfsies.}}
{{exp}}
{{Faction|Smallfolk Alliance|+}}
{{Chat|Guard Halfsies|From my dear sister, Pippi? What a sweetheart, not to mention a sweet tooth! I suppose it runs in the family. Hmm, let's have a taste, shall we?}}
{{Emote|Guard Halfsies proceeds to devour one of the jelly cupcakes in two bites. He lets out a sigh of delight as he goes in for a second, then a third, and a fourth. Crumbs pepper the halfling's mouth as he gorges himself on eleven of the dozen cakes.}}
{{Chat|Guard Halfsies|Exquisite! Delightful! Masterworks, all! I cannot thank you enough, my new best friend!}}
{{Emote|Guard Halfsies takes one final bite of the twelfth cupcake, depositing what remains of the half-eaten morsel into your hand alongside some silver coins.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive {{Money|0|0|5|0}} from Guard Halfsies.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Half of a Jelly Cupcake]] from Guard Halfsies.}}
{{Chat|Guard Halfsies|Here, some coin for your services. If only my cousin knew how to bake such wonderful delicacies, my sweet tooth wouldn't be so starved out here in Szuur!}}
{{Chat|say|Your cousin?}}
{{Chat|Guard Halfsies|Oh, my cousin? Violyn is her name. She cooks at the Crimson Oasis over in Sageside these days.}}
{{Chat|Guard Halfsies|In fact, you should show her that last portion of cupcake as a measure of what she should strive toward! I'm sure she'll be nothing but grateful to receive an example of premium baking to learn from!}}
{{QuestNote|Travel to [[Chef Violyn]], who is located at the Crimson Oasis Inn near the North Gate of [[Night Harbor]].}}
{{QuestNote|Hand the [[Half of a Jelly Cupcake]] to [[Chef Violyn]].}}
{{exp}}
{{Emote|Chef Violyn stares at the half-eaten cupcake with a look of incredulous outrage. Her face grows red as she crushes what remains of the cake in her fist and tosses it into the cooking oven.}}
{{Chat|Chef Violyn|That half-hearted, half-brained, half-witted, half-halfling Halfsies! Ooh, if he weren't my cousin I'd thrash him with my cooking iron!}}
{{Chat|Chef Violyn|He thinks he can tell me how I'm to do my baking? Oh, I'll bake him a batch of extra special cupcakes, you can be sure of that!}}
{{Emote|Chef Violyn grumbles as she scratches out a list and tosses it along with a grocery basket into your arms.}}
{{Chat|Chef Violyn|Go fill that grocery basket with the ingredients on the list! I'll make it worth your while, don't you worry. This will be a batch of cupcakes that he never forgets!}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Violyn's Grocery Basket]] from Chef Violyn.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Violyn's Grocery List]] from Chef Violyn.}}

=== A Fiery Treat ===
{{QuestInfo|Additional information regarding collection of the grocery list items would be beneficial.}}
{{QuestNote|[[Violyn's Grocery List]] notes the required items, but not where to obtain them. [[Chef Violyn]] is not willing to help, either.}}
{{Chat|say|Where can I find the items on this list?}}
{{Chat|Chef Violyn|I don't have time to direct you where to go, just find those items and bring them back to me as soon as you can!}}
{{Emote|Chef Violyn scowls as she turns back to her oven and grumbles under her breath.}}
{{QuestNote|Purchase 2 x [[Dried Dragon's Breath Pepper]] from [[Spices Merchant]] in [[Night Harbor]].}}
{{QuestNote|Purchase 1 x [[Baladi]] from the Mukhtar Brewery in the river pirate tavern.}}
{{QuestNote|Purchase 4 x [[Basilisk Seasoning]] from [[An exotic cook]] in [[Shallow Shoals]].}}
{{QuestNote|Purchase 2 x [[Viper's Kick]] which can be obtained from the [[Viper's Kick Recipe]] quest.}}
{{QuestNote|Combine 2 x [[Dried Dragon's Breath Pepper]], 1 x [[Baladi]], 4 x [[Basilisk Seasoning]], and 2 x [[Viper's Kick]] in [[Violyn's Grocery Basket]].}}
{{QuestNote|Turn in [[Violyn's Full Grocery Basket]] to [[Chef Violyn]] in [[Night Harbor]].}}
{{Faction|Smallfolk Alliance|+}}
{{Emote|Chef Violyn takes a look into the basket as her mouth curls into an insidious grin.}}
{{QuestInfo|Some of the following dialogue is incomplete and needs correction.}}
{{Chat|Chef Violyn|Yes, yes, this will do perfectly. Good job, [Player]. With this forgive for even bringing me that half-eaten pile of slop to begin With. Now to get baking...}}
{{Emote|Chef Violyn is forced to wear a mask as she combines the various ingredients into a thick mixture that stings your nostrils even from a distance. A cloud of pungent smoke billows out from the oven as the "cupcakes" bake that is enough to make your eyes water.}}
{{Emote|Chef Violyn takes the completed batch from the oven using a pair of tongs, then dumps them into a pouch which already struggles to hold back the steam escaping from the potent cakes.}}
{{Chat|Chef Violyn|Here, take these back to Halfsies so he can get a taste of real baking.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Violyn's Special Batch of Cupcakes]] from Chef Violyn.}}
{{Chat|Chef Violyn|If he survives, bring me what's left of him and you'll get your reward for all the running around you did. Oh, and you just rip up the list I gave you. You shouldn't need it any longer.}}
{{QuestNote|Give [[Violyn's Special Batch of Cupcakes]] to [[Guard Halfsies]].}}
{{Faction|Smallfolk Alliance|+}}
{{Chat|Guard Halfsies|What's this? Ah, so Violyn took it upon herself to learn from the example we sent? Good for her! Let's give these a try and see how she did!}}
{{Emote|Guard Halfsies opens the pouch and reaches in to grab a cupcake, recoiling slightly at first.}}
{{Chat|Guard Halfsies|Youch! Oh my, they're still fresh from the oven! What a charming color, as well. I better not waste any more time, then!}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Half of Violyn's Cupcake]] from Guard Halfsies.}}
{{Emote|Guard Halfsies chuckles softly and quickly brings a piping hot cupcake to his mouth, taking a bite and eating half in a single fearless chomp.}}
{{Emote|Guard Halfsies chews only once before suddenly going motionless, his face turning a brilliant crimson. He attempts to draw in a deep breath, though it only serves to further fuel the fire within his mouth. Until...}}
{{Emote|Guard Halfsies belches out a gout of flame that leaves the ends of his own hair singed. He collapses to the floor and passes out, finally taking the nap he had always longed for.}}
{{QuestNote|Give [[Half of Violyn's Cupcake]] to [[Chef Violyn]].}}
{{exp}}
{{Faction|Smallfolk Alliance|+}}
{{Emote|Chef Violyn lets out a hearty cackle as she takes the remains of the cupcake and tosses it into the oven. The pastry explodes in a small puff of flame that causes even Violyn to recoil.}}
{{Chat|Chef Violyn|Got What he deserved, I hope Halfsies has always had half a brain. He's certainly not as bright as that sister of his. I wonder how she's doing?}}
{{Emote|Chef Violyn shrugs and tosses a few coins into a wooden tankard.}}
{{Chat|Chef Violyn|This is for your trouble, some coin and a fine stein that's served me well over the years. You look worn out after all that running around.}}
{{Chat|Chef Violyn|Maybe you'd like a cupcake?}}
{{Emote|Chef Violyn grins.}}
{{Chat|Chef Violyn|Kidding, of course. Thanks again.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive {{Money|0|0|50|0}} from Chef Violyn.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Stein of Baker's Scorn]] from Chef Violyn.}}

