Diseased Wolf Pelts for Baewyn Mossfang.content:
{{Quest
| imagefilename     = Baewyn Mossfang.png
| width             = 100px
| caption           = Baewyn Mossfang
|Start Zone         = [[Faelindral]]
|Quest Giver        = [[Baewyn Mossfang]]
|Minimum Level      = 1
|Classes            = ALL
|Related NPCs       = [[A rabid wolf|a rabid wolf]]
|Quest Rewards      = (exp); (money:75)
}}

* Faction with [[Ardent Keepers]]

{{QuestInfo|This quest is repeatable.}}

== Walkthrough ==
{{QuestNote|Seek out [[Baewyn Mossfang]], located in the Beastmaster's guild in [[Faelindral]].}}
{{Chat|say|Hail, Baewyn Mossfang.}}
{{Chat|Baewyn Mossfang|Hello, friend. Do not let the fierceness of my sister discourage you from visiting the Den. She is right to be upset as she is.}}
{{Chat|say|Why is she upset?}}
{{Chat|Baewyn Mossfang|Many of the Weald's great wolves have fallen prey to a terrible malady, beset upon them by foul magic.}}
{{Chat|Baewyn Mossfang|There are many that we cannot cure in time before they throw themselves at travelers or guards.}}
{{Chat|Baewyn Mossfang|Their hides then rot and decay, spreading the sickness further. Would that I could descend to the forest floor myself, but my duties keep me here and there is no one to go on my behalf.}}
{{Chat|say|I could go on your behalf.}}
{{Chat|Baewyn Mossfang|Would you be willing to go? I would be indebted to you, <class>.}}
{{Chat|Baewyn Mossfang|If you are forced to put down any of the mad wolves, bring their infected hides to me for purification. They will be of no use to you for craft or sale otherwise.}}
{{QuestNote|Locate and kill [[a rabid wolf]] in [[Evershade Weald]] to obtain [[Diseased Wolf Pelt]].}}
{{QuestNote|Give 1 x [[Diseased Wolf Pelt]] to [[Baewyn Mossfang]].}}
{{exp}}
{{Faction|Ardent Keepers|+}}
{{Emote|Baewyn Mossfang mutters a solemn prayer to the spirits of the wild, running his palm across the disease-riddled pelt and cleansing it of its sickness.}}
{{Chat|Baewyn Mossfang|You have my appreciation for this, <class>. My sister is on the hunt for the source, but we must always do what we can to prevent the spread of illness.}}
{{Chat|Baewyn Mossfang|Please, accept this as a small measure of my gratitude. I am also able to provide cleansing to you if the illness has taken hold.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive 75 copper from Baewyn Mossfang.}}

