Archer Starter Quest (Faelindral).content:
{{NeedsInfo}}
{{HasQuickGuide}}
{{Quest
| imagefilename     = Captain Keyaryn Thornshade.png
| width             = 200px
| caption           = Captain Keyaryn Thornshade
|Start Zone         = [[Faelindral]]
|Quest Giver        = [[Commander Elydris Stormbough]]
|Minimum Level      = 1
|Classes            = [[Archer]]
|Related NPCs       = [[Captain Keyaryn Thornshade]]
|Quest Rewards      = (exp); [[Novice Scout Bracer]]; [[Weald Scout Bracer]]; [[Scout's Longbow of the Wyrdguard]]
}}

* Faction gained with [[Wyrdguard]]
* Faction lost with [[Fellstone Orcs]]

__TOC__

== Walkthrough ==
=== Part 1 - Req. Lvl 1 - Scout Courier ===
{{QuestNote|Read the [[Rolled Leafscroll]] you start with as a new Archer character:}}

<pre>
Archer,

The Wyrdguard have taken notice of your diligence and 
keen eye.

Your skills would be a welcome addition to the ranks of
Faelindral's protectors. We humbly invite you to present
this letter to Captain Keyaryn Thornshade who resides
upon Sentinels Terrace.

To reach the terrace, follow the signage past the inn and
toward the stage at the Willows Whisper. Climb the main
ascent behind the stage to reach the Traders Terrace, then
continue up the central ramp and cross the span opposite
the tanner.

The local guard can direct you further should you inquire
with them.

Your gaze shall prove to be a great asset in our upcoming
conflicts, as will the strength of your bow.

                                        Fair shades to you,
                                Commander Elydris Stormbough
</pre>

{{QuestNote|Head to Sentinels Terrace, which resides above the Traders Terrace in [[Faelindral]].}}
{{QuestNote|Take the Traveler's Lift (where you entered the game). (You can double click on the bell and the lift will come. Double click the bell again to send the lift up.)}}
{{QuestNote|Go the the inn, then up, then right (in a right angle). When you see [[Pine Brightreed]] go left. (You are now at Traders Terrace)}}
{{QuestNote|Go toward the weapons armor sign and take the ramp at the left of [[Taelin Goldstem]].}}
{{QuestNote|Take the bridge on your left, go left again and [[Captain Keyaryn Thornshade]] will be at the center of the giant trunk.}}
{{QuestNote|Give [[Rolled Leafscroll]] to [[Captain Keyaryn Thornshade]].}}
{{exp}}
{{Faction|Wyrdguard|+}}
{{Faction|Fellstone Orcs|-}}
{{Emote|Captain Keyaryn Thornshade casually accepts the scroll and unfurls it, his brow raising a touch as hazel eyes quickly scan it and then you, sharp as a hawk.}}
{{Chat|Captain Keyaryn Thornshade|Elydris's new recruit, huh? I suppose that's not the worst news that I've gotten today.}}
{{Emote|Captain Keyaryn Thornshade tosses you a small satchel that bears the weight of a number of leafscrolls.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Reconnaissance Satchel]].}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Briefing for Scout Faeweald]] from [[Captain Keyaryn Thornshade]].}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Briefing for Scout Gladebow]] from [[Captain Keyaryn Thornshade]].}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Briefing for Scout Stonebranch]] from [[Captain Keyaryn Thornshade]].}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Briefing for Scout Amber Ward]] from [[Captain Keyaryn Thornshade]].}}
{{Chat|Captain Keyaryn Thornshade|You'll start off easy, new blood. Show me that those eyes of yours really do work by seeking out the scouts that I have posted around Faelindral.}}
{{Chat|Captain Keyaryn Thornshade|Deliver these new briefings to each of them, then return to me with a bag full of their reports.}}
{{Chat|Captain Keyaryn Thornshade|Should be easy for a sureshot like you, right? Or do you need directions?}}
{{Chat|say|I could use some directions.}}
{{Emote|Captain Keyaryn Thornshade lets out a sarcastic chuckle.}}
{{Chat|Captain Keyaryn Thornshade|You'll find three of my scouts posted near the bottom of each of the great lifts around Faelindral. They should be easy enough to spot for any with a keen eye.}}
{{Chat|Captain Keyaryn Thornshade|The fourth scout, Gladebow, has been temporarily posted to Overlook Terrace due to a recently compromised platform infested with spiders. Lucky for you, that's just one span away, past the druids.}}
{{Chat|say|Infested with spiders?}}
{{Chat|Captain Keyaryn Thornshade|An entire brood of widow spiders descended from the northern cliffs not long ago. They took over a terrace and seem to be forming a nest within the great tree itself.}}
{{Chat|Captain Keyaryn Thornshade|It's one sticky situation after another with those pests, so we always need to have eyes on them.}}
{{QuestNote|Start by heading to [[Scout Gladebow]], who can be found on the platform east of Sentinel's Terrace.}}
{{QuestNote|Give [[Briefing for Scout Gladebow]] to [[Scout Gladebow]].}}
{{exp}}
{{Faction|Wyrdguard|+}}
{{Faction|Fellstone Orcs|-}}
{{Emote|Scout Gladebow accepts the briefing and offers a curt nod, exchanging it for his report.}}
{{Chat|Scout Gladebow|Ah, my thanks. You must be new to the Wyrdguard. Give the captain my regards, but try not to let his quips get to you. He can be a bit wry.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Gladebow's Report]] from [[Scout Gladebow]].}}
{{QuestNote|Next, head to [[Scout Amberward]], who can be found at the base of the Keeper's Lift in [[Evershade Weald]].}}
{{QuestNote|At the bottom of the Keeper's Lift, turn left and run through the ruins. Before crossing the bridge, turn right and you will see [[Scout Amberward]] overlooking a fallen log.}}
{{QuestNote|Give [[Briefing for Scout Amberward]] to [[Scout Amberward]].}}
{{exp}}
{{Faction|Wyrdguard|+}}
{{Faction|Fellstone Orcs|-}}
{{Emote|Scout Amberward does not seem to respond to your offered briefing at first, leaving your outstretched hand hanging in the air.}}
{{Emote|Scout Amberward finally snatches the briefing and exchanges it for what must be his report, his gaze remaining fixed upon the forest floor and the ruins in the distance.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Amberward's Report]] from [[Scout Amberward]].}}
{{QuestNote|Next, locate [[Scout Faeweald]], who is located near the base of the Pixie Lift (Druid's Circle). Descend the lift and walk straight off the ramp towards the tree.}}
{{QuestNote|Give [[Briefing for Scout Faeweald]] to [[Scout Faeweald]].}}
{{exp}}
{{Faction|Wyrdguard|+}}
{{Faction|Fellstone Orcs|-}}
{{Emote|Scout Faeweald accepts the briefing and exchanges it for a report.}}
{{Chat|Scout Faeweald|Ah, new briefings? Thank you for saving me the trek, and here's my report for Captain Thornshade.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Faeweald's Report]] from [[Scout Faeweald]].}}
{{QuestNote|Lastly, find [[Scout Stonebranch]], who is located near the base of the Traveler's Lift (Newbie Lift).}}
{{QuestNote|As you exit the Traveler's Lift, turn right and you will spot [[Scout Stonebranch]] near a bush.}}
{{QuestNote|Give [[Briefing for Scout Stonebranch]] to [[Scout Stonebranch]].}}
{{exp}}
{{Faction|Wyrdguard|+}}
{{Faction|Fellstone Orcs|-}}
{{Emote|Scout Stonebranch accepts the briefing and exchanges it with his report.}}
{{Chat|Scout Stonebranch|Oh, that time already? Here you go. Nothing much to report down here, aside from some nasty wasps.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Stonebranch's Report]] from [[Scout Stonebranch]].}}
{{QuestNote|Place [[Gladebow's Report]], [[Amberward's Report]], [[Faeweald's Report]], [[Stonebranch's Report]] into the [[Reconnaissance Satchel]] and click Combine.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You craft [[Full Reconnaissance Satchel]].}}
{{QuestNote|Return to [[Captain Keyaryn Thornshade]] and hand them the [[Full Reconnaissance Satchel]].}}
{{exp}}
{{Faction|Wyrdguard|+}}
{{Faction|Fellstone Orcs|-}}
{{Emote|Captain Keyaryn Thornshade takes the satchel and begins to leaf through the reports. His countenance hardens as he goes over Amberward's report in particular.}}
{{Chat|Captain Keyaryn Thornshade|That's just great. It seems the orcish threat has grown bolder of late, sending scouts into the lower reaches of Faelindral.}}
{{Chat|Captain Keyaryn Thornshade|You did well getting these reports, though. Take this, it'll help identify you as a novice archer for the Wyrdguard.}}
{{Emote|Captain Keyaryn Thornshade retrieves a leather wristguard and offers it to you.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Novice Scout Bracer]] from [[Captain Keyaryn Thornshade]].}}
{{QuestInfo|Completing this stage of the quest will provide five yellow bars of XP at level 1.}}

=== Part 2 - Req. Lvl 1 - Orc Intelligence Gathering ===
{{Chat|Captain Keyaryn Thornshade|I suppose there's no better way to introduce you to the ways of the scout. Care to perform a little counter-espionage?}}
{{Chat|say|Yes, I love to perform counter-espionage!}}
{{Chat|Captain Keyaryn Thornshade|Aside from being a blight on the land, we're still not sure what the orcs' goal is within Evershade.}}
{{Chat|Captain Keyaryn Thornshade|Briefings like the ones I had you deliver are not unique to the Faelewyn, though.}}
{{Chat|Captain Keyaryn Thornshade|If orcish scouts have been spotted in the Weald, then there's a chance that they're writing and sending their own reports to some... higher authority.}}
{{Chat|say|What authority?}}
{{Chat|Captain Keyaryn Thornshade|That's what I'd like you to find out. Return to Scout Amberward and tell him that you're there to gather intelligence.}}
{{Chat|Captain Keyaryn Thornshade|You're to follow his orders and see if you can determine what the ores' goal is here in the Weald.}}
{{Chat|Captain Keyaryn Thornshade|Return with what you find. If we know what they're after, we can start taking direct action to prevent it.}}
{{QuestNote|Return to [[Scout Amberward]], who can be found at the base of the Keeper's Lift in Evershade Weald.}}
{{QuestNote|At the bottom of the Keeper's Lift, turn left and run through the ruins. Before crossing the bridge, turn right and you will see Scout Amberward overlooking a fallen log.}}
{{Chat|say|The captain wants me to gather some intelligence on the orcs.}}
{{Emote|Scout Amberward gives you a piercing look, his eyes scrutinizing your equipment and overall demeanor.}}
{{Chat|Scout Amberward|If you were sent here to gather intelligence, then you'll have to show me some evidence that you've been accepted as a scout.}}
{{QuestNote|Give [[Novice Scout Bracer]] to [[Scout Amberward]].}}
{{Emote|Scout Amberward relaxes considerably upon recognizing your wristguard.}}
{{Chat|Scout Amberward|Thank the Sleepers. I've been watching the Fellstone movements for days to no avail.}}
{{Emote|Scout Amberward unstows a satchel from his belt and offers it to you, along with returning your bracer.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Scout's Satchel]] from [[Scout Amberward]].}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive your items back from Scout Amberward.}}
{{Chat|Scout Amberward|Take this satchel. It's about time we strike back. I hope you're ready to take a more... direct approach.}}
{{Chat|say|I love a direct approach, especially if it means killing!}}
{{Chat|Scout Amberward|Fellstone scouts have been spotted all across the lower Weald, far closer to Faelindral than ever before.}}
{{Chat|Scout Amberward|Some are carrying odd reports, and I believe we may be able to learn their plans if we can translate them.}}
{{Chat|Scout Amberward|I've already eliminated a few myself, but we're going to need more of those strange scribbles if we're to have any chance at deciphering their horrendous language.}}
{{Chat|Scout Amberward|Eliminate as many scouts as it takes to fll the satchel, then return it to me. May your arrows fly true, novice.}}
{{QuestNote|Hunt [[a Fellstone scout]] in [[Evershade Weald]] until you find loot 6 x [[Unintelligible Writings]].}}
