== Walkthrough ==
{{QuestInfo|Continuation of Spellblade quest}}
{{QuestInfo|Seems to be dialogue missing here. How did we get to this conversation?}}
{{QuestInfo|Is this a class restricted quest based on previous work done for Njau Hansou?}}
