Escort Head Researcher Aashir.content:
{{NeedsInfo}}
{{Quest
|imagefilename      = Head Researcher Aashir.png
|width              = 233px
|Start Zone         = [[Shaded Dunes]]
|Quest Giver        = [[Head Researcher Aashir]]
|Minimum Level      = 15
|Classes            = All
|Related NPCs       = [[a cultist]]
| Quest Rewards = [[Aashir's Earring]]
}}
== Walkthrough ==
{{QuestNote|This quest has two parts, both are dependent on the time of day within the game.}}
{{QuestNote|Part 1 of the quest in Shaded Dunes starts at 6 PM game time. If you complete Part 1, the Night Harbor version of Head Researcher Aashir will spawn and remain up until 6 AM game time. He will promptly despawn in Night Harbor at 6 AM. Requiring you to re-complete Part 1, in order to complete the reward turn in. It is recommended to complete Aashir's Journal before completing Part 1 of the quest.}}
{{QuestNote|Head Researcher Aashir is only up during the day time. He spawns at 6AM game time and will be attacked by the risen skeletons when they spawn at 6PM game time. Head Researcher Aashir is lower level than the risen skeletons so they will kill him, requiring you to wait until 6PM the next day. If you hail Head Researcher Aashir during the day he will dismiss you.}}

=== Completing Aashir's Journal ===

{{QuestNote|In Shaded Dunes around the entrance to [[Ancient Crypt]], risen skeletons and cultists spawn promptly at 6 PM game time and will despawn at 6 AM game time. They are on a 7 minute respawn timer.}}
{{Checklist|title=Kill [[a cultist]] until you have looted the following items:|
* [[Aashir's Journal]]
* [[Aashir's Journal Page 4]]
* [[Aashir's Journal Page 17]]
* [[Aashir's Journal Page 37]]
* [[Aashir's Journal Page 42]]
* [[Aashir's Journal Page 70]]
* [[Aashir's Journal Page 76]]
}}
{{QuestNote|Equip [[Aashir's Journal]] into an open bag slot. Add each journal page and click Combine to create [[Aashir's Journal completed|Aashir's Journal]].}}

=== Part 1 ===

{{QuestNote|Locate [[Head Researcher Aashir]] near the Ancient Crypt zoneline in [[Shaded Dunes]].}}
{{QuestNote|This can only be started after 6:00 PM game time once the risen skeletons have spawned nearby.}}
{{Chat|say|Hail, Head Researcher Aashir.}}
{{Chat|Head Researcher Aashir|Help, get me out of here!}}
{{Chat|say|I will help escort you out of here.}}
You say, "I will help escort you out of here."
{{QuestNote|After a brief delay, Head Researcher Aashir will start walking through the ruins towards Night Harbor. He does not provide any additional speech at this point of time.}}
{{QuestNote|You are to escort him to the far end of the ruins, killing anything along the way. There can be upwards of 3-4 Risen Skeletons attacking him at once.}}
{{QuestNote|Plan for a small group to assist in keeping the Risen Skeletons off of Head Research Aashir. If Head Research Aashir dies while being escorted, you will need to wait until 6:00 PM game time the following in-game day to try again.}}
{{QuestNote|If there are any Risen Skeletons in the area, Head Researcher Aashir will rush to attack them.}}
{{QuestNote|When you have reached the northern end of the ruins, Head Researcher Aashir will stop moving and he will give a brief statement.}}
{{Chat|Head Researcher Aashir|I thank Tilustra for your assistance! I can make it alone from here. Please go check on my men, then meet me at the tent overlooking the excavation site for the old tomb near Night Harbor.}}
{{QuestNote|Head Researcher Aashir will then depsawn from [[Shaded Dunes]] and spawn in [[Night Harbor]], on the cliff overlooking the tunnel entrance to [[Tomb of the Last Wyrmsbane]].}}

=== Part 2 ===
[[File:Clan Head Researcher Aashir - NH.png|300px|right|thumb|Head Researcher Aashir in Night Harbor.]]
{{QuestNote|You will find [[Head Researcher Aashir]] on the cliff overlooking the tunnel entrance to [[Tomb of the Last Wyrmsbane]] only after a player has completed Part 1 of this quest.}}
{{Chat|say|Hail, Head Researcher Aashir.}}
{{Chat|Head Researcher Aashir|H-h-hello... M-my apologies, I'm still trying to calm down after escaping the attack on our dig site.}}
{{Chat|say|What were you doing at the dig site?}}
{{Chat|Head Researcher Aashir|We've been researching one of the old ruins in the Shaded Dunes. The location is quite interesting, but unfortunately, I lost my journal during the attack.}}
{{Chat|say|You lost your journal?}}
{{Chat|Head Researcher Aashir|Yes! I likely lost it as I fled. It contained all of my research notes... I'll pay handsomely for it's return.}}
{{QuestInfo|There is likely some dialogue missing here...}}
{{Chat|say|What Cultists?}}
{{Chat|Head Researcher Aashir|I've heard reports of cultists int he nearby hills and stories of foreign cultists making their way into Night Harbor recently. How are we supposed to work in these conditions?}}
{{QuestNote|Give [[Aashir's Journal completed|Aashir's Journal]] to [[Head Researcher Aashir]].}}
{{exp}}
{{Faction|SCEAS|+}}
{{Emote|Head Researcher Aashir snatches the journal from your hands.}}
{{Chat|Head Researcher Aashir|You've found my journal! I can't believe this... what amazing luck!}}
{{Chat|Head Researcher Aashir|You have my eternal gratitude for this. It's not much, but please take this.}}
{{Emote|Head Researcher Aashir unhooks the hoop form his ear and gives it to you.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Aashir's Earring]] from Head Researcher Aashir.}}

