{{QuestInfo|This quest is repeatable.}}
* Faction gained with [[Citizens of Underdocks]]

== Walkthrough ==
[[File:Friendly Myconid location.png|thumb]]

{{QuestNote|[[Delilah]] is located just outside the left (west) entrance to the newbie area in the Underdocks, standing next to the Guards at the gate.}}
{{Chat|say|Hail, Delilah.}}
{{Chat|Delilah|Hi!}}
{{Emote|Delilah looks around frantically.}}
{{Chat|Delilah|Have you seen a small and incredibly cute turtle?}}
{{Chat|say|What turtle?}}
{{Chat|Delilah|I have a pet deepshell turtle named Amari.}}
{{Chat|Delilah|He is usually always by my side, but today, he has decided to wander off.}}
{{Chat|Delilah|My Pa told me that I could not go past the guards, ever!}}
{{Chat|Delilah|Could you help me and go find him?}}
{{Chat|say|I will help you find Amari.}}
{{Chat|Delilah|Thank you! Thank you!}}
{{Chat|Delilah|He is very fond of mushrooms so I would start your search there. I can see a bunch from here.}}
{{Chat|Delilah|I would go look but I can't. It's too dangerous for me.}}
{{QuestNote|Head just ahead and to the left of where Delilah is facing. Exiting the left gate to newbie zone, locate the Green mushroom on the wall towards the Northwest. You will find a small pond with green mushrooms surrounding a [[a friendly undercap]].}}
{{Chat|mud|/look}}
{{Emote|Standing beside this pool of water is a friendly-looking myconid.}}
{{Chat|say|Hail, a friendly undercap.}}
{{Emote|a friendly undercap smiles at you, while holding a small turtle under his arm.}}
{{Chat|say|May I have that turtle?}}
{{Emote|a friendly undercap gently rubs the turtle on the head.}}
{{Emote|a friendly undercap points to a stack of bone chips near his leg.}}
{{QuestNote|Hand [[a friendly undercap]] 4 x [[Bone Chips]].}}
{{Emote|a friendly undercap hugs the turtle.}}
{{Emote|a friendly undercap hands the turtle to you.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Amari]] from [[a friendly undercap]].}}
{{QuestNote|Return [[Amari]] to [[Delilah]] by handing the turtle to her.}}
{{Chat|Delilah|Amari! I have missed you so much.}}
{{Chat|Delilah|Never run off like that again!}}
{{Chat|Delilah|When I first found Amari as a small turtle, he was near a giant, old shell.}}
{{Chat|Delilah|I have no use for it.}}
{{Chat|Delilah|Please accept it as a token of my gratitude.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Turtle Shell Shield]] from [[Delilah]].}}
{{exp}}
{{Faction|Citizens of Underdocks|+}}

== Notes ==

* Prior to patch 0.30.3.2, this quest rewarded [[Greater Turtle Shell Shield]] (formerly labeled as "Giant Turtle Shell Shield").
** Due to the MAGIC flag on this item and relative ease of acquiring it, players would repeat this quest for faction and early materials for [[Disenchanting]] and [[Enchanting]].
** To balance the availability of early game enchanting resources, this item was rebuilt as [[Turtle Shell Shield]] to prevent mass acquisition of enchanting goods.
** Players who obtained [[Greater Turtle Shell Shield]] prior to patch 0.30.3.2 retained the item, making it a [[:Category:Removed Items| Legacy item]] which can no longer be obtained.

