Fungal Armor Quests.content:
{{NeedsInfo}}
{{HasQuickGuide}}
{{Quest
| imagefilename     = Deep Elf Fungal Armor.jpg
| width             = 280px
| caption           = Full set of Fungal armor
|Start Zone         = [[Ail'Vorith]]
|Quest Giver        = [[Leatherworker Vex]]
|Minimum Level      = 5
|Classes            = ALL
|Related NPCs       = [[a cave myconid]]
|Related Items      = 
|Quest Rewards = [[Fungal Coat]]; [[Fungal Helm]]; [[Fungal Leggings]]; [[Fungal Boots]]
}}


== Overview ==

For a full set of Fungal armor, you will need:

* 7 x [[Strong Fungus Hyphea]]
* 5 x [[Perfect Fungus Cap]]
* 4 x [[Perfect Fungus Volva]]
* 3 x [[Perfect Fungus Stem]]

== Walkthrough ==
{{MessageBox
| class = warning
| img = Itemicon0001AA.png
| header = Change Language to Deep Common
| message = Be sure you have set your language to Deep Common (right-click Main Chat window > Languages > Deep Common), or quest NPCs may not respond to your prompts.
}}

{{Chat|say|Hail, Leatherworker Vex.|Deep Common}}
{{Chat|Leatherworker Vex|You breathe still?  Good. Most who come here are already food for what lurks in the shadows.}}
{{Chat|Leatherworker Vex|I am Vex. I stitch what the Deep provides into something that keeps you alive longer.}}
{{Chat|say|What is something that could keep me alive longer?|Deep Common}}
{{Chat|Leatherworker Vex|Do you seek protection or purpose? I can give you both if you care to aim above the rest.}}
{{Chat|say|I seek protection.|Deep Common}}
{{Chat|Leatherworker Vex|In the caves of the Deep one race has thrived the most. They grow in darkness, they consume death, and they do not break. The myconids.}}
{{Chat|Leatherworker Vex|Bring me the intact parts of the mature ones, and I will stitch them into armor that protects your flesh.}}
{{Chat|Leatherworker Vex|I can fashion a coat, leggings, helm and boots.}}

<div style="background:#f9f9f9; border:1px solid #ddd; padding:10px; margin-bottom:10px;">
=== [[Fungal Coat]] ===
{{Chat|say|What Coat?|Deep Common}}
{{Chat|Leatherworker Vex|For the coat, I require three perfect fungus caps, two strong fungus hyphea, and one perfect fungus stem.}}
{{Chat|Leatherworker Vex|The cap forms the plates, the hyphea binds them, and the stem reinforces the spine.}}
{{QuestNote|Hunt [[a cave myconid]] and loot 3 x [[Perfect Fungus Cap]], 2 x [[Strong Fungus Hyphea]] and 1 x [[Perfect Fungus Stem]]. Hand these items to [[Leatherworker Vex]].}}
{{Emote|Leatherworker Vex takes the items and carefully layers the caps, weaves the hyphea through them, and reinforces the seams with the stem. The armor pulses faintly with bioluminescence.}}
{{Chat|Leatherworker Vex|It is done. Wear it well. The Deep recognizes its own.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Fungal Coat]] from [[Leatherworker Vex]].}}
{{exp}}
{{Faction|House Velgarrith|+}}
{{Faction|Citizens of Ail'Vorith|+}}
{{QuestInfo|As a Level 6 Deep Elf Archer on 2026-09-21, my faction for House Velgarrith was set to almost full Indifferent, and I gained 1 blue bar of faction with Citizens of Ail'vorith.}}
</div>

<div style="background:#f9f9f9; border:1px solid #ddd; padding:10px; margin-bottom:10px;">
=== [[Fungal Helm]] ===
{{Chat|say|What Helm?|Deep Common}}
{{Chat|Leatherworker Vex|For the helm, I require two perfect fungus caps and one strong fungus hyphea.}}
{{Chat|Leatherworker Vex|The caps shield the skull, and the hyphea cushions the brow. Do not bring damaged caps; they will crack under pressure.}}
{{QuestNote|Hunt [[a cave myconid]] and loot 2 x [[Perfect Fungus Cap]] and 1 x [[Strong Fungus Hyphea]]. Hand these items to [[Leatherworker Vex]].}}
{{Emote|Leatherworker Vex takes the items and molds the caps into a dome, lines the interior with hyphea, and seals the edges. The helm glows softly.}}
{{Chat|Leatherworker Vex|Your head and mind are now shielded. Do not let the whispers in.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Fungal Helm]] from [[Leatherworker Vex]].}}
{{exp}}
{{Faction|House Velgarrith|+}}
{{Faction|Citizens of Ail'Vorith|+}}
{{QuestInfo|As a Level 6 Deep Elf Archer on 2026-09-21, I gained one full bar plus one blue bar from Indifferent to Amicably with House Velgarrith, and I gained a tenth of a blue bar of faction with Citizens of Ail'vorith.}}
</div>

<div style="background:#f9f9f9; border:1px solid #ddd; padding:10px; margin-bottom:10px;">
=== [[Fungal Leggings]] ===
{{Chat|say|What Leggings?|Deep Common}}
{{Chat|Leatherworker Vex|For the leggings, I require two perfect fungus stems, two strong fungus hyphea, and two perfect fungus volva.}}
{{Chat|Leatherworker Vex|The stems form the greaves, the hyphea allows movement, and the volva protects the knee.}}
{{QuestNote|Hunt [[a cave myconid]] and loot 2 x [[Perfect Fungus Volva]], 2 x [[Strong Fungus Hyphea]] and 2 x [[Perfect Fungus Stem]]. Hand these items to [[Leatherworker Vex]].}}
{{Emote|Leatherworker Vex accepts the items and shapes the stems into greaves, binds them with hyphea, and caps the knee with the volva. The leggings flex silently.}}
{{Chat|Leatherworker Vex|This should allow you some protection while still being able to move quietly.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Fungal Leggings]] from [[Leatherworker Vex]].}}
{{exp}}
{{Faction|House Velgarrith|+}}
{{Faction|Citizens of Ail'Vorith|+}}
{{QuestInfo|As a Level 6 Deep Elf Archer on 2026-09-21, I gained one full bar plus one blue bar from Indifferent to Amicably with House Velgarrith, and I gained a tenth of a blue bar of faction with Citizens of Ail'vorith.}}
</div>

<div style="background:#f9f9f9; border:1px solid #ddd; padding:10px; margin-bottom:10px;">
=== [[Fungal Boots]] ===
{{Chat|say|What Boots?|Deep Common}}
{{Chat|Leatherworker Vex|For the boots, I require two perfect fungus volva and two strong fungus hyphea.}}
{{Chat|Leatherworker Vex|The volva forms the sole, and the hyphea wraps the ankles. Silent tread is the gift of the fungus.}}
{{QuestNote|Hunt [[a cave myconid]] and loot 2 x [[Perfect Fungus Volva]] and 2 x [[Strong Fungus Hyphea]]. Hand these items to [[Leatherworker Vex]].}}
{{Emote|Leatherworker Vex takes the items from you and flattens the volva into soles, then wraps the hyphea around the ankles, and stitches the seams. The boots make almost no sound when set down.}}
{{Chat|Leatherworker Vex|Tread softly, the Deep rewards silence.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Fungal Boots]] from [[Leatherworker Vex]].}}
{{exp}}
{{Faction|House Velgarrith|+}}
{{Faction|Citizens of Ail'Vorith|+}}
</div>

{{QuestInfo|Any further breadcrumbs when a full set is acquired...?}}

