== Walkthrough ==

{{QuestNote|[[Quessith Velgarrith]] is located in the Great Cavern Sea at the outpost directly outside of Ail'Vorath.  Hail her in Deep Common.}}

{{Chat|say|Hail, Quessith Velgarrith.}}
{{Chat|Quessith Velgarrith|Mind the crates, Almond.  A sealed letter for [[Munir Halabi]] of the Underwatch came through the gates with the cargo.  Would you carry it to him in the Underdocks?}}
{{Chat|say|I will carry the letter.}}
{{Emote|Quessith Velgarrith hands you the sealed letter.}}
{{Chat|Halveth Velgarrith|Take the passage beside the gate into the Caves of Irem, then go on to the Underdocks.  Put it in Munir Halabi's hand.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Sealed Underwatch Letter]] from Quessith Velgarrith.}}
''More information is needed.  As of October 19, 2026, Munir Halabi is not locateable in the Underdocks.''
