Cargo Inspection.content:
{{Quest
| imagefilename     = Mobimage-ysmaravelgarrith.png
| width             = 100px
| caption           = Photo by Almond
|Start Zone         = [[Great Cavern Sea]]
|Quest Giver        = [[Ysmara velgarrith]]
|Minimum Level      = 1
|Classes            = All
|Related NPCs       = [[Ysmara velgarrith]]
|Quest Rewards      = 
|Related Items      = 
}}

== Walkthrough ==

{{QuestNote|[[Ysmara velgarrith]] is located above the large waterfall in the Great Cavern Sea.  Hail her in Deep Common.}}

{{Chat|say|Hail, Ysmara Velgarrith.}}
{{Chat|Ysmara  Velgarrith|The public cargo stacks haven't had an inspection this month.  That's the work.  I settle the fee once it's complete.}}
{{Chat|say|What inspection?}}
{{Chat|Ysmara Velgarrith|Here's your inspection kit and two holding tags, Almond.  Four cargo stacks sit on the public floor.  Work them in order and tag anything that fails.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Cargo Seal Inspection Kit]] from Ysmara Velgarrith.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Numbered Holding Tag]] from Ysmara Velgarrith.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Numbered Holding Tag]] from Ysmara Velgarrith.}}

''More information is needed.  As of October 20, 2026, there are several boxes nearby but MUD commands do not seem to work.''
