== Walkthrough ==

{{QuestNote|[[Drelith Vael'xirith]] is located in the Great Cavern Sea close to the Blacktide Orc camp.  Hail her in Deep Common.}}

{{Chat|say|Hail, Drelith Vael'xirith.}}
{{Chat|Drelith Vael'xirith|Keep to the safe route, Almond.  Blacktide orcs stage ships at the camp below the falls, and I want their written orders.  Have you seen any orders on them?}}
{{Chat|say|What orders?}}
{{Chat|Drelith Vael'xirith|The orc who holds them is [[Overseer Vashruk]].  He keeps to the camp's defended rear.  Get the sealed orders off him, Almond, and put them in my hand.}}
{{Chat|say|I will get the sealed orders.}}
{{Chat|Drelith Vael'xirith|The sealed orders are on Overseer Vashruk.  He keeps to the defended rear, below the falls.}}

{{QuestNote|Go and slay [[Overseer Vashruk]].  He spawns randomly in the last group of orcs closest to the falls.  Return the [[Blacktide Order Packet]] he drops to Drelith.}}
{{Emote|Drelith Vael'xirith turns the sealed orders toward the light and reads.}}
{{Chat|Drelith Vael'xirith|So the staging is directed from elsewhere.  That is what I needed.  Thank you, Almond.  Here, two healing draughts.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Scout's Mending Draught]] from Drelith Vael'xirith.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive 3 silver from Drelith Vael'xirith.}}
