Pests at the Farm.content:
{{Quest
| imagefilename     = Farmer Ammar.png
| width             = 100px
| caption           = Farmer Ammar
|Start Zone         = [[Night Harbor]]
|Quest Giver        = [[Farmer Ammar]]
|Minimum Level      = 1
|Classes            = All
|Related NPCs       = [[Fadila]]
|Related Items      = [[Snake Egg]]; [[Scarab Leg]]; [[Fire Beetle Legs]]; [[Raw Rat Meat]]; [[Raw Jackal Meat]]
|Quest Rewards      = (exp); [[Ration]]; [[Water Flask]]; [[Torch]]
}}

{{QuestInfo|This quest is repeatable.}}

== Walkthrough ==

{{QuestNote|[[Farmer Ammar]] is located at the farm just northeast of the caster tower outside of the North Gate of [[Night Harbor]].}}
{{Chat|say|Hail, Farmer Ammar.}}
{{Chat|Farmer Ammar|Hello! It's good to see you.}}
{{Chat|Farmer Ammar|As you can see, we've been overrun by pests. Our loyal farmhand and I can barely keep up with these filthy interlopers.}}
{{Chat|Farmer Ammar|Care to help us out?}}
{{Chat|say|I will help you.}}
{{Chat|Farmer Ammar|Oh, Krivea's blessings upon you, friend!}}
{{Chat|Farmer Ammar|My wife, Fadila, is in the house. Bring her proof you've slain these pests... preferably something we can cook up.}}
{{Chat|Farmer Ammar|We'll reward you with what we can. We don't have much, but perhaps some of our supplies could help you on your journey.}}
{{Chat|say|What sort of proof do you require?}}
{{Chat|Farmer Ammar|Ah, looking for specifics? Fair enough.}}
{{Chat|Farmer Ammar|How about meat from the four-legged ones, eggs from the snakes, and legs from the beetles?}}
{{QuestNote|You are looking for any of the following drops:}}
* [[Snake Egg]]
* [[Scarab Leg]]
* [[Fire Beetle Legs]]
* [[Raw Rat Meat]]
* [[Raw Jackal Meat]]
{{QuestNote|When you have acquired some proof, turn them in to [[Fadila]] back at the farm. She is located in the house behind [[Farmer Ammar]].}}
{{exp}}
{{Chat|Fadila|Krivea's blessings for your assistance!}}
{{Chat|Fadila|It's not much, but please accept this gift in return.}}
{{QuestInfo|You receive, at random<ref>Probabilities: [[Torch]] 10%, [[Water Flask]] 45%, [[Ration]] 45%</ref>, a [[Torch]], a [[Water Flask]] or a [[Ration]] from [[Fadila]].}}

