Little Tamsah, Big Appetite.content:
{{Quest
| imagefilename     = Little Tamsah.png
| width             = 300px
| caption           = So hungry...
|Start Zone         = [[Night Harbor]]
|Quest Giver        = [[Old Mother Roshan]]
|Minimum Level      = 1
|Classes            = All
|Related NPCs       = [[Little Tamsah]]
|Related Items      = [[Raw Rat Meat]]; [[Raw Jackal Meat]]; [[Raw Bat Meat]]
|Quest Rewards      = (exp)
}}

* Faction gained with [[Seekers of the Lost Eye]].

{{QuestInfo|This quest is repeatable.}}

== Walkthrough ==

{{QuestNote|[[Old Mother Roshan]] is located inside the Seekers of the Lost Eye Temple on the ground level in [[Night Harbor]].}}
{{Chat|say|Hail, Old Mother Roshan.}}
{{Emote|Old Mother Roshan straightens up, her old bones creaking, yet there's a youthful energy in her movements.}}
{{Chat|Old Mother Roshan|Oh, hello, dear. The Seekers of the Lost Eye welcome you. Are you looking for some work, perhaps?}}
{{Chat|say|I am looking for some work!}}
{{Chat|Old Mother Roshan|Ah, wonderful. I have a small task for you.}}
{{Chat|Old Mother Roshan|Little Tamsah is hungry and needs some meat. Her favorite is rat meat, though she'd be more than happy with jackal or bat meat. Really, as long as it's not gator meat, I'm sure she'll be satisfied!}}
{{Chat|Old Mother Roshan|Just watch your fingers when you give it to her, she doesn't discriminate.}}
{{Emote|Old Mother Roshan cackles.}}
{{QuestNote|[[Little Tamsah]] is a crocodile located inside the Seekers of the Lost Eye Temple on the ground level in [[Night Harbor]].}}
{{QuestNote|Hand 1 x [[Raw Rat Meat]], 1 x [[Raw Jackal Meat]], or 1 x [[Raw Bat Meat]] to [[Little Tamsah]].}}
{{Emote|Little Tamsah snaps up the meat greedily with her strong jaws, her body almost twisting it from your hand. Within a second, the meat is gone. Little Tamsah watches you in anticipation.}}
{{exp}}
{{Faction|Seekers of the Lost Eye|+}}
{{QuestInfo|You can hand in meat in increments of 1 x, 5 x, or 20 x for larger faction hits. Verified 2026-10-19.}}

