Green Drakeling Scale Armor Quests.content:
{{NeedsInfo}}
{{HasQuickGuide}}
{{Quest
| imagefilename     = Takalea Scaletender Photo.png

| width             = 500px
| caption           = Quest giver Takalea Scaletender
|Start Zone         = [[Faelindral]]
|Quest Giver        = [[Takalea Scaletender]]
|Minimum Level      = 1
|Classes            = All
|Related NPCs       = [[a green drakeling]]
|Quest Rewards      = [[Green Drakeling Scale Coat]]; [[Green Drakeling Scale Cloak]]; [[Green Drakeling Scale Pants]]; [[Green Drakeling Scale Boots]]
}}

[[File:Green Drakeling Set- Front.png|thumb|Green Drakeling Set- Front]]
[[File:Green Drakeling Set - Back.png|thumb|Green Drakeling Set- Back]]

== Overview ==

{{QuestInfo|As a general tip, you can often find [[Green Drakeling Scale]], [[Green Drakeling Wing]], [[Green Drakeling Hide]], and [[Green Drakeling Poison Duct]] for sale on the vendors across Faelindral.}}
{{QuestInfo|As this quest gets more popular the [[Green Drakeling Poison Duct]] are less likely to be found on vendors as they seem particularly rare - I've seen 1 in 40 kills. The general technique is to kill everything in the newbie yard as it seems all of them are PH's for the drakeling.}}
{{QuestInfo|For a full set of Green Drakeling armor, you will need:}}
{| class="wikitable style="text-align: center;"
|+ 
|-
! Drop !! Total !! Coat !! Cloak !! Pants || Boots
|-
| [[Green Drakeling Scale]] || 15 || 6 || 3 || 4 || 2
|-
| [[Green Drakeling Wing]] || 7 || 2 || 2 || 2 || 1
|-
| [[Green Drakeling Hide]] || 8 || 4 || 1 || 2 || 1
|-
| [[Green Drakeling Poison Duct]] || 2 || 1 || - || 1 || -
|}

== Walkthrough ==
{{QuestNote|Find [[Takalea Scaletender]], located at the tannery in [[Faelindral]].}}
{{Chat|say|Hail, Takalea Scaletender.}}
{{Chat|Takalea Scaletender|Fair shades to you, friend! Have you come to explore the ways of tanning and hide? It's rewarding trade that will have you learning about every facet of Aethoril's beasts.}}
{{Chat|say|I have come to explore the ways of tanning and hide.}}
{{Chat|Takalea Scaletender|Everything you need to learn the basics of leatherworking should be here at the tannery, from workstations to supplies. Just don't inhale too many fumes from the tanning vats!}}
{{Chat|say|Tell me about Aethoril's beasts.}}
{{Chat|Takalea Scaletender|Oh yes! From the thick hide of a monstrous grizzly, to the supple skin of a desert serpent; leatherworkers are capable of taking nature's protection and making it our own.}}
{{Chat|Takalea Scaletender|Why, even my own attire was fashioned from the scales of young drakelings.}}
{{Chat|say|What drakelings?}}
{{Chat|Takalea Scaletender|Caught your attention, did it?}}
{{Chat|Takalea Scaletender|I've found that drakeling scales have a remarkable protective qualities for their size. I imagine it has to do with their inherent magical nature.}}
{{QuestInfo|How do we know to ask about materials here?}}
{{Chat|say|What materials are required?}}
{{Chat|Takalea Scaletender|That depends... which piece are you interested in? I can fashion boots, a cloak, pants, or a coat for you out of green drakeling parts.}}
{{QuestInfo|How do we know to ask about the Poison Ducts here?}}
{{Chat|say|ducts}}
{{Chat|Takalea Scaletender|The ducts can be rather rare, but they're also quite important for the larger pieces I can make. The poisonous secretions can be turned into a lacquer that gives the scales a real luster!}}

<div style="background:#f9f9f9; border:1px solid #ddd; padding:10px; margin-bottom:10px;">
=== [[Green Drakeling Scale Coat]] ===
{{Chat|say|What Coat?}}
{{QuestInfo|Need dialogue from Takalea here.}}
{{QuestNote|Turn in 6 x [[Green Drakeling Scale]], 2 x [[Green Drakeling Wing]], 4 x [[Green Drakeling Hide]], 1 x [[Green Drakeling Poison Duct]] to [[Takalea Scaletender]].}}
{{exp}}
{{Faction|Defenders of Faelindral|+}}
{{Faction|Citizens of Faelindral|+}}
{{Chat|Takalea Scaletender|Incredible! You really must have put a dent in the drakeling population down there, huh? Let me get to work right away.}}
{{Emote|Takalea Scaletender expertly fashions the drakeling parts into a beautiful coat that glistens with green scales.}}
{{Chat|Takalea Scaletender|Here you are friend! I hope it protects you as much as it does me.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Green Drakeling Scale Coat]] from [[Takalea Scaletender]].}}
</div>

<div style="background:#f9f9f9; border:1px solid #ddd; padding:10px; margin-bottom:10px;">
=== [[Green Drakeling Scale Cloak]] ===
{{Chat|say|What Cloak?}}
{{QuestInfo|Need dialogue from Takalea here.}}
{{QuestNote|Turn in 3 x [[Green Drakeling Scale]], 2 x [[Green Drakeling Wing]], 1 x [[Green Drakeling Hide]] to [[Takalea Scaletender]].}}
{{exp}}
{{Faction|Defenders of Faelindral|+}}
{{Faction|Citizens of Faelindral|+}}
{{Chat|Takalea Scaletender|Ah, this should be just enough! One moment friend, while I get to work.}}
{{Emote|Takalea Scaletender carefully fashions the hide and scales into a sturdy green cloak.}}
{{Chat|Takalea Scaletender|There all done! No adventurer should go without a reliable cloak on their shoulders. It's all yours friend.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Green Drakeling Scale Cloak]] from [[Takalea Scaletender]].}}
</div>

<div style="background:#f9f9f9; border:1px solid #ddd; padding:10px; margin-bottom:10px;">
=== [[Green Drakeling Scale Pants]] ===
{{Chat|say|What Pants?}}
{{QuestInfo|Need dialogue from Takalea here.}}
{{QuestNote|Turn in 4 x [[Green Drakeling Scale]], 2 x [[Green Drakeling Wing]], 2 x [[Green Drakeling Hide]], 1 x [[Green Drakeling Poison Duct]] to [[Takalea Scaletender]].}}
{{exp}}
{{Faction|Defenders of Faelindral|+}}
{{Faction|Citizens of Faelindral|+}}
{{Chat|Takalea Scaletender|Wonderful! It's rare to come across and intact poison duct, so you must be rather fortunate! I'll get to work straight away.}}
{{Emote|Takalea Scaletender carefully fashions the drakeling parts into a set of durable pants.}}
{{Chat|Takalea Scaletender|There, one set of drakeling scale pants! May they serve you well friend.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Green Drakeling Scale Pants]] from [[Takalea Scaletender]].}}
</div>

<div style="background:#f9f9f9; border:1px solid #ddd; padding:10px; margin-bottom:10px;">
=== [[Green Drakeling Scale Boots]] ===
{{Chat|say|What Boots?}}
{{QuestInfo|Need dialogue from Takalea here.}}
{{QuestNote|Turn in 2 x [[Green Drakeling Scale]], 1 x [[Green Drakeling Wing]], 1 x [[Green Drakeling Hide]] to [[Takalea Scaletender]].}}
{{exp}}
{{Faction|Defenders of Faelindral|+}}
{{Faction|Citizens of Faelindral|+}}
{{Chat|Takalea Scaletender|Great work! I should be able to make some nice sturdy boots with this. One moment...}}
{{Emote|Takalea Scaletender quickly stitches together a pair of rugged boots that glint with green scales.}}
{{Chat|Takalea Scaletender|Here you are, friend! A good solid pair of boots can never be underestimated.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Green Drakeling Scale Boots]] from [[Takalea Scaletender]].}}
</div>

