Kill Tora'Galdo.content:
{{NeedsInfo}}
{{Quest
| imagefilename     = Mar'Tem.jpg
| width             = 300px
| caption           = 
|Start Zone         = [[Fallen Pass]]
|Quest Giver        = [[Mar'Tem]]
|Minimum Level      = 30+
|Classes            = ALL
|Related NPCs       = [[Tora'Galdo]]
|Quest Rewards      = [[Small Mur'Hua Trinket]]
}}

== Walkthrough ==
{{QuestNote|This quest starts with hailing [[Mar'Tem]].}}
{{QuestInfo|Where is the quest giver located in the zone?}}
{{Chat|say|Hail, Mar'Tem.}}
{{Chat|Mar'Tem|Hail, Yes, I speak your language, though I am the only one in our gathering who does.}}
{{Chat|Mar'Tem|We mean no harm to your kind. In fact, we are the ones who fear harm. We have fled to this shelter to escape the hunters tracking us.}}
{{Chat|Mar'Tem|The undead here have done well to keep them in the tunnel but it is only a matter of time before they come for us.}}
{{Chat|say|What hunters?}}
{{Chat|Mar'Tem|A group of us were able to flee the Skri'Var taskmasters before they could cause us to degenerate.}}
{{Chat|Mar'Tem|We escaped here, but if the hunters leave, we will eventually make our way out of this place and return to our village.}}
{{Chat|Mar'Tem|Or, if you can force them away, we would also be grateful. Just bring me proof that you have dealt with them.}}
{{Chat|say|Degenerate?}}
{{Chat|Mar'Tem|The Skri'Var were once like us Mur'Hua. But those with bad spirits wander away from our people and devolve into what you see here. We take care of each other, and we love to explore and create. They are selfish and kill and steal.}}
{{Chat|Mar'Tem|They can force us to become like them by isolating us from each other, torturing us, and making us cannibals like them.}}
{{Chat|Mar'Tem|Once this process beings, our spirits change and our minds give way. We serve them, protect them, and become like them. So, take care if you see any Mur'Hua among them. They are already likely lost.}}
{{Chat|say|What Village?}}
{{Chat|Mar'Tem|We come from a small village on a lake deep below the surface... but I do not know you well enough to tell you more.}}
{{Chat|say|What proof?}}
{{QuestInfo|Need more information regarding dialogue here}}
{{QuestNote|Venture out and kill [[Tora'Galdo]].}} 
{{QuestNote|Loot his [[Head of Tora'Galdo]] and return to [[Mar'Tem]].}}
{{QuestNote|Upon turning in the [[Head of Tora'Galdo]] Mar'Tem responds:}}
{{Chat|Mar'Tem|It is a shame that one of our own can cause so much death and hardship. We are immensely grateful for this act of kindness.}}
{{Chat|Mar'Tem|Please take this as a small token of my gratitude. It may help you, should you encounter more of my people.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Small Mur'Hua Trinket]].}}

{{QuestInfo|More information needed. Faction hits? EXP? Coin?}}
{{QuestInfo|Suspected to be a second quest available once you have completed the first.}}

