== Walkthrough ==
{{QuestNote|[[Mierra Willowshade]] is located inside the building adjacent to the Inn next to the Newbie Lift.}}
{{Chat|say|Hail, Mierra Willowshade.}}
{{Chat|Mierra Willowshade|Fair shades to you! We have plenty of delicious goods for sale if you're looking for something scrumptious. Though, I'm unfortunately out of my famed jelly cupcakes.}}
{{Chat|say|What famed jelly cupcakes?}}
{{Chat|Mierra Willowshade|They're sold out faster than I can whip them up! You look like a capable sort, though. Tell you what... could you gather more of my special ingredient? I'll make it worth your while!}}
{{Chat|say|What special ingredient?}}
{{Emote|Mierra Willowshade lowers her voice to a whisper and leans in close to you.}}
{{Chat|Mierra Willowshade|Shh, not so loud! It's special, but also secret! You'll need to gather some royal jelly from the wasps down on the forest floor.}}
{{Chat|Mierra Willowshade|Bring me four helpings of that precious jelly and I'll bake a special batch of my jelly cupcakes, just for you! You'll be the talk of the terrace!}}
{{QuestNote|Collect 4 [[Royal Jelly]] from [[a wasp drone]] or [[a wasp worker]] in [[Evershade Weald]], then return to [[Mierra Willowshade]] and hand them to her.}}
{{Chat|Mierra Willowshade|Oh, this is perfect! You wait right there while I get these prepared for you!}}
{{Emote|Mierra Willowshade hums a tune as she sets to work preparing a batch of freshly baked jelly cupcakes. The aroma is sweet and delectable as she pulls them from the oven and wraps them in paper for you.}}
{{Chat|Mierra Willowshade|Here you are, <player>! Thank you so much for your help. I'll use the extra jelly to bake cupcakes for tomorrow's batch. If you ever come across more, you know where to find me!}}
{{exp}}
{{Faction|Citizens of Faelindral|+}}
