|Quest Rewards      = [[Black Crude Silk Shirt]]; [[Orange Crude Silk Shirt]]; [[Yellow Crude Silk Shirt]]; [[Blue Crude Silk Shirt]]; [[Red Crude Silk Shirt]]; [[Green Crude Silk Shirt]]; [[White Crude Silk Shirt]]; [[Black Crude Silk Robe]]; [[Orange Crude Silk Robe]]; [[Yellow Crude Silk Robe]]; [[Blue Crude Silk Robe]]; [[Red Crude Silk Robe]]; [[Green Crude Silk Robe]]; [[White Crude Silk Robe]];
}}

== Notes ==

{{QuestNote|The Red Dye basin is currently unresponsive to MUD commands, and as a result you may not be able to craft [[Red Crude Silk Shirt]] or [[Red Crude Silk Robe]] until this is patched.}}
{{QuestNote|Large character models (such as Ogres or Humans) may have a difficult time entering the dye vats to complete the necessary MUD commands. You can safely complete this by placing your dirty shirt or robe in a shared bank to transfer the item to a freshly created level 1 gnome alt if needed.}}
{{QuestInfo|This quest is repeatable.}}
{{QuestInfo|You will need 24 x [[Crude Spider Silk]] per shirt or robe, or 336 x [[Crude Spider Silk]] for every combination of shirt and robe.}}
{{QuestInfo|The colored shirts and robes are tradeable and can be sold to shady merchants for 20 copper, cloth armor merchants for 50 copper, or other players for substantially more.}}

