<li>[[Mining Pick of Trem]]</li>
<li>[[Rope, Blessed, 50 Length]]</li>
</ul>
}}

{{QuestInfo|Is this quest repeatable...?}}

== Walkthrough ==
=== Part 1 - Quality Samples ===

{{QuestNote|Find [[Tust Brookturner]], located at the Quarry in [[Sungreet Strand]].}}
{{Chat|say|Hail, Tust Brookturner.}}
{{Emote|Tust Brookturner glances up past his worn, dusty spectacles.}}
{{Chat|Tust Brookturner|Ah! You're finally here. This is great news, great news indeed! You brought the quarry samples, I presume?}}
{{Chat|say|What samples?}}
{{Emote|Tust Brookturner pushes his spectacles up the bridge of his nose.}}
{{Chat|Tust Brookturner|Oh, my mistake. I thought you were the laborer assigned to collect quarry samples for me.}}
{{Chat|Tust Brookturner|You'll do, though! All you need is a mining pick. You're familiar with mining, yes?}}
{{Chat|Tust Brookturner|Here, take this sack, fill it with quality samples, and bring it back to me for inspection. In return, you'll receive coin!}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Tust's Burlap Sack]] from Tust Brookturner.}}
{{QuestNote|Fill the sack with 8 pieces of [[Quarry Stone]] from mining in quarry.}}
{{QuestNote|Combine to create [[Full Burlap Sack]].}}
{{QuestNote|Return to [[Tust Brookturner]] and hand him the [[Full Burlap Sack]].}} 
{{Chat|Tust Brookturner|Yes, yes! This will do quite nicely. Here's the coin that was promised.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive 3 copper from Tust Brookturner.}}
{{QuestInfo|Faction hits/EXP}}
{{QuestInfo|Your faction standing with Citizens of Night Harbor got better}}
{{QuestInfo|Your faction standing with Congregation of Trem got better}}
{{ReceiveItem|You gain experience!}}

=== Part 2 - Ample Samples ===

{{Chat|Tust Brookturner|You seem quite skilled with a pickaxe. Some of the workers here mentioned seeing traces of exceptional minerals at the site. If you're interested in a bit of a challenge, I could use your help.}}
{{Chat|say|I am interested in a bit of a challenge.}}
{{Chat|Tust Brookturner|Good, good! Now, let me see... where did I put that list? Mrs. Pebblebank! Do you have the list of minerals I jotted down earlier?}}
{{Chat|Tust Brookturner|Ah, nevermind! Here it is.}}
{{Chat|Tust Brookturner|The ample sample list is as follows... four pieces of pyrite ore, three clear crystal shards, two smoky shards, and a flawless clear quartz.}}
{{Chat|Tust Brookturner|Place the minerals in this case and seal it, then bring the case and note back to me. A full case of minerals means a full payout in coin! Good luck!}}
{{QuestInfo|Need item name and ID for the ingredient list.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Tust's Display Case]] from Tust Brookturner.}}
[[File:Ample-mineral-samples.png|thumb|alt=Ample-mineral-samples|Ample-mineral-samples]]
{{Checklist|title=From the [[Quality Quarry Stone]] nodes, mine the requested minerals|
* 4 x [[Pyrite Ore]]
* 3 x [[Clear Quartz Shard]]
* 2 x [[Smoky Quartz]]
* 1 x [[Flawless Clear Quartz]]
}}
{{QuestNote|Place each item in single stacks of 1 into [[Tust's Display Case]] and click Combine.}}
{{QuestInfo|Combine to create [[Full Display Case]].}}
{{QuestNote|Return to [[Tust Brookturner]] and hand him the [[Full Display Case]].}}
{{Chat|Tust Brookturner|Good... no, splendid work!}}
{{Chat|Tust Brookturner|Well then, a reward is in order. Take this as a token of appreciation from the Church of Trem.}}
{{QuestNote|You will randomly receive one of the following items as a reward:}}
<tabber>
Tust's Copper Earring={{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Tust's Copper Earring]] from Tust Brookturner.}}
|-|
Rope, Blessed, 50 Length={{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Rope, Blessed, 50 Length]] from Tust Brookturner.}}
|-|
Wand of Heal={{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Wand of Heal]] from Tust Brookturner.}}
|-|
Survey Pack={{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Survey Pack]] from Tust Brookturner.}}
</tabber>
{{ReceiveItem|You receive 4 copper from Tust Brookturner.}}
{{QuestInfo|Faction hits/EXP}}
{{QuestInfo|Your faction standing with Citizens of Night Harbor got better}}
{{QuestInfo|Your faction standing with Congregation of Trem got better}}
{{ReceiveItem|You gain experience!}}


