|Classes            = ARC BRD BST CLR DRU FTR INQ MNK PAL RNG ROG SHD SHM SPB
|Related NPCs       = [[A poacher pathfinder]], [[A poacher bruiser]], [[A poacher herbalist]], [[a poacher]]
|Quest Rewards      = (exp); [[High Keeper's Vambrace]]
}}

* Faction gained with [[Ardent Keepers]].
* Faction gained with [[Village of Penshaw]].
* Faction gained with [[Poachers of Calafrey]].
{{QuestInfo|This quest is repeatable.}}

== Walkthrough ==

{{QuestNote|[[Ranger Rylin]] is located in the large treehouse in [[Keeper's Bight]], located next to one of the internal stairwells.}}
{{Chat|say|Hail, Ranger Rylin.}}
{{Chat|Ranger Rylin|Greetings, <class>. I am Rylin of the [[Ardent Keepers]], sworn warden of Evershade Weald's ancient forests and surrounding lands. I have been sent here to root out the poachers who scar this land with their blatant disregard of the natural order. If you are willing to aid our cause, I have a reward selected by the High Keeper himself for your efforts.}}
{{Chat|say|I am willing to aid your cause.}}
{{Chat|Ranger Rylin|Your resolve honors our cause, <class>. The poachers wield skinning knives etched with their foul mark. Bring me four of them as proof of your deed, and I shall reward your service. May the forests' will guide you.}}
{{QuestNote|You need to hunt poacher variants such as [[a poacher]] and collect 4 x [[Poacher's Skinner]].}}
{{QuestNote|When you have collected 4 x [[Poacher's Skinner]], give them to [[Ranger Rylin]].}}
{{Chat|Ranger Rylin|You have done a great service for the [[Ardent Keepers]] and the Keepers Bight, Cilantro! The forest breathes easier thanks to your efforts. Now, take this bracer as a symbol of our gratitude and your bond to our cause.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[High Keeper's Vambrace]] from Ranger Rylin.}}
{{exp}}
{{Faction|Ardent Keepers|+}}
{{Faction|Village of Penshaw|+}}
{{Faction|Poachers of Calafrey|-}}

