| width             = 200px
| caption           = 
|Start Zone         = [[Keeper's Bight]]
|Quest Giver        = [[Fendris the Forsaken]]
|Minimum Level      = 30
|Classes            = All
|Related NPCs       =
[[an undead poacher]]
[[Poacher Tolan]]
[[Poacher Garrus]]
[[A cave bear]]
[[A fat cave bear]]
| Related Items =
[[Torn Leather Bracer]] 
[[Garrus's Tattered Boots]]
[[Garrus's Tattered Leggings]]
[[Tolan's Torn Hide Vest]]
[[Tolan's Chipped Skinner]]
|Quest Rewards      = (exp)
[[Debtcarver]]
[[Vest of Shattered Duty]]
[[Leggings of Reckoning]]
[[Boots of Vengeful Resolve]]
}}

{{QuestInfo|This quest is repeatable.}}
{{QuestInfo|Required quest items dropped by mobs are NODROP, meaning they cannot be traded once looted.}}

= Walkthrough =

{{QuestNote|Locate [[an undead poacher]] inside the bear cave near the Tree House.}}
{{Chat|say|Hail, an undead poacher.}}
{{Chat|an undead poacher|Betrayed... cowards...}}
{{Chat|say|Who betrayed you?}}
{{Chat|an undead poacher|My memory has faded... even my name is lost to me. Yet I remember the two men whose names were known by all... simply for surviving. Cowards. They left me to die.}}
{{QuestInfo|Is there any further dialogue here?}}
{{QuestNote|Loot [[Torn Leather Bracer]] from [[a cave bear]].}}
{{QuestNote|Give [[Torn Leather Bracer]] to [[an undead poacher]].}}
{{Emote|an undead poacher transforms as his memory returns to him. The bracer falls to the ground and you pick it back up.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive your items back from an undead poacher.}}
{{QuestNote|[[Torn Leather Bracer]] is handed back to you. [[an undead poacher]] despawns and [[Fendris the Forsaken]] spawns in their place.}}
{{Chat|say|Hail, Fendris the Forsaken.}}
{{Chat|Fendris the Forsaken|I linger here, shackled by vengeance. When the bears descended upon our camp, my companions ran and left me to die.}}
{{Chat|Fendris the Forsaken|This corpse cannot hunt them down... but you can. Bring me proof of their deaths, as well as my bracer, and I will see you rewarded before my spirit is free.}}
{{QuestNote|There are several items that can be obtained as 'proof' of death. Each object of proof results in a different item.}}
{{QuestNote|Upon turning in an item of proof, [[Fendris the Forsaken]] will despawn. [[an undead poacher]] has a roughly 5 minute respawn timer.}}

== [[Debtcarver]]  == 

{{QuestNote|Loot [[Tolan's Chipped Skinner]] from [[Poacher Tolan]].}}
{{QuestNote|Loot [[Torn Leather Bracer]] from [[a cave bear]].}}
{{QuestNote|Give [[Torn Leather Bracer]] to [[an undead poacher]] to spawn [[Fendris the Forsaken]].}}
{{QuestNote|Hand in [[Tolan's Chipped Skinner]] and [[Torn Leather Bracer]] to Fendris the Forsaken.}}
{{QuestInfo|Any dialogue here?}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Debtcarver]] from Fendris the Forsaken.}}
{{exp}}
{{QuestInfo|Any faction hits?}}

== [[Vest of Shattered Duty]]  == 

{{QuestNote|Loot [[Tolan's Torn Hide Vest]] from [[Poacher Tolan]].}}
{{QuestNote|Loot [[Torn Leather Bracer]] from [[a cave bear]].}}
{{QuestNote|Give [[Torn Leather Bracer]] to [[an undead poacher]] to spawn [[Fendris the Forsaken]].}}
{{QuestNote|Hand in [[Tolan's Torn Hide Vest]] and [[Torn Leather Bracer]] to Fendris the Forsaken.}}
{{Emote|Fendris the Forsaken draws the vest close, the torn leather knitting itself together under ghostly light.}}
{{Chat|Fendris the Forsaken|Tolan wore this while he was meant to keep watch. He slept instead. Let this vest remember the weight of that failure.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Vest of Shattered Duty]] from Fendris the Forsaken.}}
{{exp}}
{{QuestInfo|Any faction hits?}}

== [[Leggings of Reckoning]]  ==

{{QuestNote|Loot [[Garrus's Tattered Leggings]] from [[Poacher Garrus]].}}
{{QuestNote|Loot [[Torn Leather Bracer]] from [[a cave bear]].}}
{{QuestNote|Give [[Torn Leather Bracer]] to [[an undead poacher]] to spawn [[Fendris the Forsaken]].}}
{{QuestNote|Hand in [[Garrus's Tattered Leggings]] and [[Torn Leather Bracer]] to Fendris the Forsaken.}}
{{Emote|Fendris the Forsaken glows faintly as he grips the tattered leggings, the fabric stiffening beneath his touch.}}
{{Chat|Fendris the Forsaken|Those bore Garrus away from the fight, while I was torn apart. Let them now serve someone who stands their ground.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Leggings of Reckoning]] from Fendris the Forsaken.}}
{{exp}}
{{QuestInfo|Any faction hits?}}

== [[Boots of Vengeance]]  ==

{{QuestNote|Loot [[Garrus's Tattered Boots]] from [[Poacher Garrus]].}}
{{QuestNote|Loot [[Torn Leather Bracer]] from [[a cave bear]].}}
{{QuestNote|Give [[Torn Leather Bracer]] to [[an undead poacher]] to spawn [[Fendris the Forsaken]].}}
{{QuestNote|Hand in [[Garrus's Tattered Boots]] and [[Torn Leather Bracer]] to Fendris the Forsaken.}}
{{Emote|Fendris the Forsaken glows faintly as his hand closes around the boots.}}
{{Chat|Fendris the Forsaken|Garrus thought himself brave... until fear found him first. May these boots carry you where he faltered.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Boots of Vengeance]] from Fendris the Forsaken.}}
{{exp}}
{{QuestInfo|Any faction hits?}}

