Mushroom Menace.content:
{{NeedsInfo}}
{{Quest
| imagefilename     = mushroom menace.png
| width             = 300px
| caption           = A docile bluecap
|Start Zone         = [[Evershade Weald]]
|Quest Giver        = [[Sporeweaver Underveil]]
|Minimum Level      = <= 5 (mobs to kill much higher: yellow to L12)
|Classes            = All
|Related NPCs       = [[a beguiled bluecap]], [[a beguiled water elemental]]
|Quest Rewards      = [[Staff of Spores]]; (exp)
}}

* Faction increase with [[Circle of Spores]].

== Walkthrough ==
{{QuestNote|[[Sporeweaver Underveil]] is located in the mushroom cave close to [[Faelindral]].}}
{{Chat|say|Hail, Sporeweaver Underveil.}}
{{Chat|Sporeweaver Underveil|I welcome you to the depths of Sporehaven Karst, <class>. Our myconids are of no threat under normal circumstances, though it appears something has tampered with the latest strain.}}
{{Chat|say|What latest strain?}}
{{Chat|Sporeweaver Underveil|I cannot say for certain what is causing the aggression in our latest strain, but I do have my suspicion. They seem to get riled when the sun sets and a mysterious foam builds along the riverbanks of the Karst.}}
{{Chat|say|What mysterious foam?}}
{{Chat|Sporeweaver Underveil|I have discovered traces of the mysterious foam caught in the gills of some of our myconid children, though I have not yet procured enough to get an understanding of what it truly is.}}
{{Chat|Sporeweaver Underveil|Should a myconid become enthralled by the substance, they soon begin sending out messages of warning through the nerve structures  of their surrounding kin, riling them into a defensive frenzy.}}
{{Chat|Sporeweaver Underveil|I am loathe to ask this of you, stranger, but I am not strong enough to bring low any of my children. Would you be able to take a stand against my beguiled creations?}}
{{Chat|say|I will take a stand.}}
{{Emote|Sporeweaver Underveil lets out a sad breath, nodding in understanding.}}
{{Chat|Sporeweaver Underveil|Then I entrust the deed to you. Seek out my beguiled children here in the Karst; the bluecaps appear to be the most susceptible at night.}}
{{Chat|Sporeweaver Underveil|Cull what you must to procure a section of their gills that shimmers with traces of the prismatic foam. Bring what you find to me, so I can save what remains of our latest strain.}}
{{Emote|Sporeweaver Underveil lowers his head somberly.}}
{{QuestNote|Collect one [[Prismatic Gills]] from [[a beguiled bluecap]] during the night and deliver them to [[Sporeweaver Underveil]].}}
{{exp}}
{{Faction|Circle of Spores|+}}
{{Faction|Naelira's Court|-}}
{{Emote|Sporeweaver Underveil accepts the gills with a frown.}}
{{Chat|Sporeweaver Underveil|Such a waste of a beautiful strain. I understand why it had to be done, but this goes against the balance of the Weald. My poor children were never meant to be enthralled by something not of this world.}}
{{Chat|Sporeweaver Underveil|Which is precisely what this magic resembles... the machinations of the naiads. I had my suspicions, but this evidence you brought me confirms them.}}
{{Chat|Sporeweaver Underveil|They have tainted the river with their influence. To what end, I care not. I only ask, will you provide me the opportunity to avenge my fallen kin?}}
{{Emote|Sporeweaver Underveil clasps his hands to yours, placing a small glass phial into your palm as he stares intently at you.}}
{{Chat|say|I will avenge your fallen kin.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Underveil's Phial]] from Sporeweaver Underveil.}}
{{Emote|Sporeweaver Underveil lets out a sigh of relief.}}
{{Chat|Sporeweaver Underveil|Thank you, stranger. Enter the domain of the naiads and use what force or guile is necessary to reach the pools that dwell within.}}
{{Chat|Sporeweaver Underveil|Rumors tell of their ability to enthrall beings of pure water. If these rumors hold true, I need you to collect at least four samples of this enchanted water so that I can study it and develop a countermeasure for my own creations.}}
{{Chat|Sporeweaver Underveil|Do this for me, and you will have the eternal gratitude of the Circle of Spores. I wish you luck, stranger.}}
{{QuestNote|Collect 4 [[Enchanted Water]] from [[a beguiled water elemental]] in the naiad cave upstream and combine them in [[Underveil's Phial]].}}
{{QuestNote|After handing Sporeweaver Underveil the completed sample you receive [[Staff of Spores]].}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Staff of Spores]] from Sporeweaver Underveil.}}
{{QuestInfo|Need combined item name, along with relevant dialogue, exp, money, faction hits.}}

