Hale's Haul.content:
{{Quest
| imagefilename     = Captain_Hale.png
| width             = 300px
| caption           = Captain Hale
|Start Zone         = [[Keeper's Bight]]
|Quest Giver        = [[Captain Hale]]
|Minimum Level      = 20
|Classes            = All
|Related NPCs       = N/A
|Quest Rewards      = (exp); (money:0,0,20,0)
}}

* Faction gained with [[Red Mantles]]
* Faction gained with [[Langsdorfian League]]
* Faction gained with [[Village of Penshaw]]

{{QuestInfo|This quest is repeatable.}}

== Walkthrough ==
{{QuestNote|On the docks of [[Keeper's Bight]], in the last ship, you'll find [[Captain Hale]].}}
{{Chat|say|Hail, Captain Hale.}}
{{Chat|Captain Hale|You've picked a fine day to be poking around. You might be able to help me, though. We're in a bit of a bind.}}
{{Chat|say|I can help.}}
{{Chat|Captain Hale|The storm that blew through last night shook part of the cargo load loose, and the Harbormaster's already been warning us that if we don't recover it, it'll be a disaster.}}
{{Chat|Captain Hale|We're waiting on our equipment to arrive to we can retrieve it, but my crew feels uneasy about what's been lurking down there. I can't blame them.  We all saw their shadows gliding through the waves.}}
{{Chat|say|What is lurking down there?}}
{{Chat|Captain Hale|There's no mistaking it.  Great bight sharks have been circling the shallows. Regardless, the cargo was heavy and wouldn't have floated too far. Whatever went over would've settled on the seabed just offshore.}}
{{Chat|Captain Hale|We estimate we've lost at least five creates. If you're willing to brave the water and bring them back, I'll see you paid for the trouble.}}
{{QuestNote|[[Captain Hale]] has asked for your assistance recovering five lost crates of goods from the bottom of the bay beneath the dock, which were lost in a recent storm.}}
{{QuestNote|The [[Salvaged Cargo Crate]] are resting on the bottom of the ocean. These are collected using MUD commands.}}
{{QuestNote|Additionally, the crates have a cooldown before they can be looted by another player. You will need to use the MUD /look command to confirm if a crate is lootable before attempting to pick it up.}}
{{QuestNote|Be mindful, as there are several [[a great bight shark]] swimming around the bay, which are level 20-30 and aggressive.}}
{{Chat|mud|/look}}
{{QuestInfo|If the crate cannot be looted...}}
{{Emote|You are in Keeper's Bight.}}
{{QuestInfo|If the crate can be looted...}}
{{Emote|A crate rests on the seabed with its cargo still intact.}}
{{Chat|mud|/take crate}}
{{Emote|You wrench the cargo free from the crate, taking everything you can carry.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Salvaged Cargo Crate]].}}
{{QuestNote|Once you have 5 crates, return to [[Captain Hale]].}}
{{Chat|Captain Hale|Good work, <player>! Anything left out there will be split or dragged out by tomorrow. You saved what could be saved. Here, as promised, take this for doing us a solid favor. My crew already looks relieved."}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive 20 silver from Captain Hale.}}
{{Faction|Langsdorfian League|+}}
{{Faction|Red Mantles|+}}
{{Faction|Village of Penshaw|+}}

