Grub for the Miners.content:
{{NeedsInfo}}
{{Quest
| imagefilename     = phicon.png
| width             = 100px
| caption           = Placeholder Image
|Start Zone         = [[Sungreet Strand]]
|Quest Giver        = [[Foreman Stonehammer]]
|Minimum Level      = 1
|Classes            = All
|Related NPCs       = [[a cinder worker]]
|Quest Rewards      = (exp); [[Boiled Beetle Legs]],2
}}

{{QuestInfo|This quest is repeatable.}}

== Walkthrough ==

{{QuestNote|[[Foreman Stonehammer]] is located on a platform in the north west corner of the quarry in [[Sungreet Strand]], near [[Sister Elara]].}}
{{QuestInfo|Needs initial dialogue on hail and breadcrumbs.}}
{{Chat|Foreman Stonehammer|The miners are already grumbling that there's not enough chow.}}
{{Chat|Foreman Stonehammer|Hmmm, I think I have an idea that will solve one of our problems and fill our bellies at the same time.}}
{{Chat|say|What food?}}
{{Chat|Foreman Stonehammer|Yes, we need more food.  I've had to portion out our rations since the shipment is late... but I think I've got an idea that could help us out...}}
{{Chat|say|What is your idea?}}
{{Chat|Foreman Stonehammer|Have ya ever had steam crab legs fresh out of the harbor?  Delicious aren't they?}}
{{Chat|Foreman Stonehammer|Well, I've been think'... maybe, just maybe, these cinder beetles are kinda like those crabs.}}
{{Chat|Foreman Stonehammer|Bring me six tender beetle legs and I'll try cookin' them up for the crew.}}
{{Chat|Foreman Stonehammer|You know how to tell if the legs will be tender, don't ya?}}
{{Chat|say|How will I tell if they'll be tender?}}
{{Chat|Foreman Stonehammer|Yes, Yes, it must be tender meat. Old meat is too tough.}}
{{Chat|Foreman Stonehammer|I'd look for cinder beetles that are younger... smaller... the hardest workers in the swarm.  Their legs will have plenty of meat on 'em.}}
{{QuestNote|Kill [[a cinder worker]] in the Quarry below and loot 6 x [[Tender Beetle Legs]].}}
{{QuestNote|Give Foreman Stonehammer 6 x [[Tender Beetle Legs]].}}
{{Chat|Foreman Stonehammer|Yes, this will do perfectly. Wait here a moment.}}
{{Emote|Foreman Stonehammer tosses the tender beetle legs into a pot of water.}}
{{Emote|Foreman Stonehammer stires the pot as the water begins to boil.}}
{{Emote|Foreman Stonehammer pulls a bright red beetle leg from the pot, cracks it open, and...}}
{{Emote|Foreman Stonehammer begins to eat the succulent white meat.}}
{{Chat|Foreman Stonehammer|This is delicious! Ya ought t' try it. Here, and a few copper for your troubles.}}
{{exp}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive 2x [[Boiled Beetle Legs]] from Foreman Stonehammer.}}
{{QuestInfo|Missing any faction hits or coin gained.}}


