{{QuestInfo|This quest is repeatable.}}

== Walkthrough ==
{{QuestNote|[[Hult Beetlewrangler]] is located in the rear of the Sojourner Camp in [[Night Harbor]]. He can wander a short distance from his tent throughout the day.}}
{{Chat|say|Hail, Hult Beetlewrangler.}}
{{Chat|Hult Beetlewrangler|Woah, ho there, adventurer. Ya lookin for work or wares? No matter, ol' Hult's got somethin for ya either way.}}
{{Chat|say|I am looking for work.}}
{{Chat|Hult Beetlewrangler|Well, if ya were from 'round here, ya'd know Hult's got the best bowls all 'long the Twilight Coast. Though, if ya ain't from 'round here, or either way I reckon, what ya need to know is I need me some beetle shells.}}
{{Chat|say|What beetle shells?}}
{{Chat|Hult Beetlewrangler|Yep, beetle shells make dang fine bowls, they do. See, a beetle shell's got the most perfectly natural shape and sturdiness for makin' bowls, and Porbor knows ol' Hult can make somethin' outta anythin'.}}
{{Chat|Hult Beetlewrangler|So, go out in them dunes over yonder and wrangle me at least two of 'em! When ya get back, ol' Hult'll see 'bout gettin' ya somethin' nice for yer troubles.}}
{{QuestNote|Hunt [[a fire beetle]] and Loot 2 x [[Fire Beetle Carapace]].}}
{{QuestNote|Give [[Hult Beetlewrangler]] 2 x [[Fire Beetle Carapace]].}}
{{exp}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Hult's Beetle Bowl]] from [[Hult Beetlewrangler]].}}
{{Chat|Hult Beetlewrangler|Ho, welcome back, friend. Seems yer a dang fine beetle wrangler. Ya've done good by Hult, so take one o' these here beetle bowls. It ain't much, but I reckon it'll serve ya well.}}

