Glinting Hollow Key Quest.content:
{{NeedsInfo}}
{{HasQuickGuide}}
{{Quest
| imagefilename     = glowingfaescale.jpg
| width             = 100px
| caption           = Glowing Fae Scale (GH Key)
| Start Zone    = [[Evershade Weald]]
