| Minimum Level = 35+
| Classes       = ALL
| Related NPCs  = [[Sporeweaver Underveil]], [[Lilac Latespring]], [[Sersil Tangleroot]]
| Quest Rewards = [[Glowing Fae Scale]]
}}


== Walkthrough ==

{{QuestNote|Acquire [[Warped Scale]] from [[a warped fae]] near druid mushroom circle in [[Evershade Weald]]. This item doesn't always drop. [[a warped fae]] always spawns at 2AM game time. It will path to the [[Glinting Hollow]] zoneline and despawn if left untouched.}}
{{QuestNote|Acquire [[Twisted Scale]] from [[a twisted fae]] up the ramp near the broken undead ruins by the [[Keeper's Bight]] zoneline. This item doesn't always drop. [[a twisted fae]] always spawns at 3AM game time. It will path to the [[Glinting Hollow]] zoneline and despawn if left untouched.}}
{{QuestNote|Turn in a [[Spark of Magic]] (via [[Skill Disenchanting| Disenchanting]]) to [[Sporeweaver Underveil]] in the mushroom cave to receive [[Ancient Mushroom Powder]].}}
{{QuestNote|Turn in [[Twisted Scale]] and [[Warped Scale]] to [[Lilac Latespring]] to get [[Bundle of Scales]].}}
{{QuestNote|Turn in [[Bundle of Scales]] and [[Ancient Mushroom Powder]] to [[Sersil Tangleroot]] to receive [[Glowing Fae Scale]].}}
{{QuestNote|Turn in [[Glowing Fae Scale]] to [[Lilac Latespring]] to receive a 2nd version of it with a different tooltip (A bright, pulsating scale that feels both cold and warm at the same time.) which is the final key.}}

== Entry Dialog ==

{{QuestInfo|This quest needs further dialogue for each step and turn in, along with xp, faction hits, coin.}}

{{QuestNote|Find [[Scout Brightleaf]] outside the [[Glinting Hollow]] zoneline, uphill from the druid ring in [[Evershade Weald]]. He is stealthed but can be seen up close at the appropriate level (DB at 42).}}

{{Chat|say|Hail, Scout Brightleaf.}}
{{Chat|Scout Brightleaf|Shhh, I'm investigating the fae. Don't let them notice me.}}
{{Chat|say|What about the fae are you investigating?}}
{{Chat|Scout Brightleaf|I'm part of the Wyrdguard, sent to investigate strange fluctuations in Wyrdgate energy around the area.}}
{{Chat|Scout Brightleaf|There have been some oddities, to say the least.}}
{{Chat|say|Fluctuations?}}
{{Chat|Scout Brightleaf|Around this very area, yes. I saw it with my own eyes... they approached the center of the pit and a gate suddenly opened.}}
{{Chat|Scout Brightleaf|It closed moments later, and I didn't dare try and enter uninvited.}}
{{Chat|Scout Brightleaf|I could use some help figuring this out, if you're willing?}}

