== Related Items ==
* Hathalian Spire Research by Vhaleth Hal'kareth

== Walkthrough ==

{{QuestNote|This quest starts at the conclusion of the [[Ail'Vorith Starter Quest]] after you receive your [[Obsidian Shackle]].}}

=== Part 1 - ? ===
{{QuestNote|[[Myal Vehear]] is located in the Obsidian Academy, 2nd floor.}}
{{Chat|say|Hail, Myal Vehear.|Deep Common}}
{{Emote|Myal Vehear closes the ebon colored book that she is reading and slowly turns her gaze to you.}}
{{Chat|Myal Vehear|And who do we have here?  A fresh and eager mind, ready to explore the mysteries of the Planes?}}
{{Chat|Myal Vehear|The world is but one connected through space to the Planes and Spirals.}}
{{Emote|Myal Vehear gazes through you, as if peering into the void beyond.}}
{{Chat|Myal Vehear|I have been tasked with seeking out knowledge of the Spirals.  Would you like to assist?}}
{{Chat|say|assist|Deep Common}}
{{Chat|Myal Vehear|I would like to supplement my research with that of the Deep gnomes dwelling outside of Ail'vorith.}}
{{Chat|Myal Vehear|Take this binder.  Seek them out and retrieve six of their research pages for me to consider.}}
{{Chat|Myal Vehear|Consider your actions wisely.  By completing this assignment, you will pledge yourself to House Hal'kareth.}}
{{QuestInfo|The gnome researchers are named [[A spirals deepgnome researcher]]; they are located in the caverns behind the main city of Ail'vorith. The best way I can describe getting to them is jumping left off the bridge that goes into the main city and swimming until you see some elementals on your left; go past these elementals. Eventually, you will see some slimes and some [[deep gnome researchers]] that are indifferent; these are not the correct ones. You then go up the ramps, avoiding anything that says [[a failed experiment]], as they are aggressive slimes.}}
{{QuestNote|The pages are quite rare; it took about 3 hours to get 3 spellblades their pages.}}
'''Take the binder back to Myal Vehear he then gives you a coin to take to Ailis Hal'arketh.'''
'''Take the coin to Ailis Halkareth and she gives you a signet ring.'''
{{QuestNote|[[Ailis Hal'arketh]] is located in the Inner City, on the shore. When you go to the inner city from Foreign Quarter, at the bridge near the gates of inner city, stop and look left. You see the shore and a couple of houses. That shore has Ailis Hal'Arketh in of the house. To access it, take the turn left then tunnel left from the city gate.}}
{{QuestInfo|More information is needed. Correct NPC names? Steps? Dialogue?}}

=== A note for Vhaleth Hal'kareth  ===
{{QuestNote|Vhaleth Hal'kareth is located in the great cavern sea behind the big tower that you see on the left when taking the boat from Ail'vorith to the Underdocks; he is beside some [[shore beetle|shore beetles]] as well as some various skeletons and a wizard's spire.}}
'''Take him the note and then he goes on to say the following after you trade it to him.'''
{{QuestInfo|What note was given? By what NPC?}}
{{chat|Valheth Hal'kareth|If only you had been here sooner, I would have the research!}}
{{emote|Valheth Hal'kareth looks around distraught.}}
{{chat|Valheth Hal'kareth|I spent several weeks studying the spire. Analyzing it with detection and divination magics.}}
{{chat|Valheth Hal'kareth|I was so engrossed in my studies that I did not notice that each time I expended magical energy toward the spire, it awakened something below the surface.}}
{{emote|Valheth Hal'kareth looks around with dread.}}
{{chat|Valheth Hal'kareth|Undead hathalian explorers rose from the sand and ambushed me. I dropped my research notes in haste and retreated a safe distance away from them.}}
{{chat|Valheth Hal'kareth|They have the research that Allis desires. Slay them and retrieve it.}}
{{QuestInfo|The halathian explorers are not called explorers; they are called wizard's shamans and zombies and are located right next to him they eventually will drop the spire research.}}
[[File:Hathalian spire research.png|thumb]]

'''You will then take the Hathalian spire research notes back to Ailis Hal'kareth along with the ring'''
{{QuestInfo|Need more information on the name of ring and how you get it. Dialogue? NPCs?}}
{{emote|Ailis Hal'arketh holds out her hands greedily and receives the research.}}
{{chat|Ailis Hal'arketh|You have done well.}}
{{chat|Ailis Hal'arketh|This research should provide insight into the Hal'arkath ruins and the magic contained within.}}
{{emote|Ailis Hal'arketh receives your signet ring and waves her left hand over it slowly.}}
{{chat|Ailis Hal'arketh|I will fortify the ring to strengthen it for you.}}
{{chat|Ailis Hal'arketh|You have shown great promise and ambition. These are needed within our House.}}
{{chat|Ailis Hal'arketh|Go out and practice. Strengthen yourself in magic and grow in strength.}}
'''She rewards you with an upgraded Improved Hal'Kareth Signet Ring. Need dialogue, stats, etc'''
{{QuestInfo|More information is required...}}

