== Walkthrough ==

{{QuestNote|This quest starts at the conclusion of the [[Ail'Vorith Starter Quest]] after you receive your [[Obsidian Shackle]].}}

=== Part 1 - A Letter of Recommendation - Req. Lvl 1 ===
{{QuestNote|[[Amarah Ith'vayen]] is located in the front left corner of the first floor of the caster hall in the Obsidian Academy.}}
{{Chat|say|Hail, Amarah Ith'vayen.|Deep Common}}
{{Chat|Amarah Ith'vayen|House Ith'vayen gathers bits and bobs from all over to provide intelligence to our Queen and the Great Houses.}}
{{Chat|Amarah Ith'vayen|If an upstart group of exiles needs to be spied upon, we are called.}}
{{Chat|Amarah Ith'vayen|When a minor House needs to be blackmailed to comply, we are up to the task.}}
{{Chat|Amarah Ith'vayen|Need someone dead and buried, never to be seen again?  That's us.}}
{{Chat|Amarah Ith'vayen|Just don't expect to be able to prove it was us.}}
{{Emote|Amarah Ith'vayen laughs loudly.}}
{{Chat|Amarah Ith'vayen|So, my pretty kulzzann, do you want to complete a task for me and start earning a seat at our fine table?}}
{{Chat|say|what task|Deep Common}}
{{Chat|Amarah Ith'vayen|Go out and gather myconid parts for us.  We use them in various alchemical concoctions and our supply is running low.}}
{{Chat|Amarah Ith'vayen|Bring me back eight of these and I might think about you for more than a fleeting moment in time.}}
{{Chat|Amarah Ith'vayen|OH! Tell me when you are ready to go, because I've been dying to try out my new wand.}}
{{Chat|Amarah Ith'vayen|It is probably safe.}}
{{Chat|say|ready|Deep Common}}
{{Chat|Amarah Ith'vayen|And just like that you are there.}}
{{Chat|Amarah Ith'vayen|Or a pile of goo!}}
{{QuestInfo|You do not have to use the teleport to complete the quest.}}
{{QuestInfo|You are teleported out of the city and to the left across the bridge, up the ramp and to the right (most of the way to the zone safe point).}}
{{QuestNote|Defeat [[a cave myconid]] and collect the [[Myconoid Parts]]. Upon turning in eight [[Myconid Parts]]:}}
{{Chat|Amarah Ith'vayen|Delightful, just delightful.}}
{{Emote|Amarah Ith'vayen places the myconic parts on the table behind her.}}
{{Chat|Amarah Ith'vayen|You're going places.  Where those places are is for you to decide.  I'm going to provide you with a letter of introduction to House Ith'vayen.}}
{{Chat|Amarah Ith'vayen|Go see my brother, his name is [[Aleyz Ith'vayen]].  Tell him his sister said hello and to watch his back.}}
{{Emote|Amarah Ith'vayen grins ominously.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive a [[Letter to Aleyz]].}}

<tabber>
|-|Enchanter=
{{ReceiveItem|You receive a [[Cloth Belt of Runes]].}}
|-|Rogue=
{{ReceiveItem|You receive a [[Leather Belt of Runes]].}}
</tabber>

{{exp}}

=== Part 2 - A Letter of Recommendation - Req. Lvl 5+ ===

{{QuestNote|Begins when you turn in a [[Letter to Aleyz]] to [[Aleyz Ith'vayen]] inside the main city.}}
{{Chat|Aleyz Ith'vayen|Hah!  The nerve of that woman.}}
{{Chat|Aleyz Ith'vayen|I should have strangled her while she was in the crib as a babe.}}
{{Chat|Aleyz Ith'vayen|Let me have a look at you.}}
{{Emote|Aleyz Ith'vayen looks at $n closely.}}
{{Chat|Aleyz Ith'vayen|There is not much to work with but I shall try.}}
{{Chat|Aleyz Ith'vayen|I need you to gather some ingredients for one of my projects.}}
{{Chat|Aleyz Ith'vayen|Bring me one fire elemental stone, three samples of ooze and one whitefish.}}
{{Emote|Aleyz Ith'vayen makes a sweeping motion.}}
{{Chat|Aleyz Ith'vayen|Go now and be quick about it.}}
{{QuestNote|Bring one [[Fire Elemental Stone]], three [[Ooze Secretions]] and one [[Whitefish]] to Aleyz.}}
{{Emote|Aleyz Ith'vayen takes the items and approaches his workbench.}}
{{Chat|Aleyz Ith'vayen|I will mix the ooze you gathered with equal parts water and ammonia.}}
{{Emote|Aleyz Ith'vayen mixes the items together in a large decanter.}}
{{Chat|Aleyz Ith'vayen|Next I will heat the mixture in a fire stoked with the fire elemental stone.}}
{{Emote|Aleyz Ith'vayen places the decanter on top of a large burner and reinforces the flame with the stone.}}
{{Chat|Aleyz Ith'vayen|Give it a few minutes to heat and combine.}}
{{Emote|Aleyz Ith'vayen waits several moments and then removes the heated mixture.}}
{{Chat|Aleyz Ith'vayen|I need most of this for a project that the House assigned me, but I can spare a bit for a personal errand.}}
{{Emote|Aleyz Ith'vayen fillets the fish and then slathers it in the mixture.  He begins to roast it on the burner.}}
{{Chat|Aleyz Ith'vayen|It smells delightful.}}
{{Chat|Aleyz Ith'vayen|Are you ready for one more mission?}}
{{Chat|say|I am ready|Deep Common}}
{{Chat|Aleyz Ith'vayen|Take this cooked fish back to my sweet sister.}}
{{Chat|Aleyz Ith'vayen|Place it nearby without being noticed.}}
{{Chat|Aleyz Ith'vayen|She never could pass up a meal.}}
{{Chat|Aleyz Ith'vayen|Return to me once the mission is complete and let me know that the fish has been delivered.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive a [[Roasted and Poisoned Fish]].}}
{{QuestNote|Return to [[Amarah Ith'vayen]].  Stealth or Invis and use the MUD commands /look table. }}
{{Chat|mud|/look table}}
{{Emote|Looking around, you notice a table full of documents nearby. You should be able to place the fish here for her to notice.}}
{{QuestNote|While holding the [[Roasted and Poisoned Fish]] use the MUD command /place table.}}
{{Chat|mud|/place table}}
{{QuestInfo|As of 2026-10-12, this MUD command appears to be bugged and is not triggering correctly.}}
{{QuestInfo|As of 2026-10-14, this MUD command is working.}}
{{QuestInfo|As of 2026-10-14, after patch rollback this MUD command is NOT working.}}
{{QuestInfo|As of 2026-10-15, this is working as of today.}}
{{Emote|As the fish meal is placed on the table, Amarah sniffs the air.}}
{{Emote|She turns to the table, smiles and begins to eat the meal.}}
{{Emote|Suddenly, her face turns green and she rushes out of the room, dropping the half-eaten fish.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive a [[Half-Eaten Poisoned Fish]].}}
{{QuestNote|Return to [[Aleyz Ith'vayen]] and give him the [[Half-Eaten Poisoned Fish]]. }}
{{Chat|Aleyz Ith'vayen|I wish I could have been there!}}
{{Chat|Aleyz Ith'vayen|I bet she ran as quickly as she could to flee the room.}}
{{Emote|Aleyz Ith'vayen laughs loudly.}}
{{Chat|Aleyz Ith'vayen|Good work! We showed her who is in charge around here.}}
{{exp}}
{{Faction|House Ith'vayen|+}}
{{Chat|Aleyz Ith'vayen|Let me see that belt of yours.}}
{{QuestNote|Give [[Aleyz Ith'vayen]] your [[Cloth Belt of Runes]] or [[Leather Belt of Runes]].}}
{{Emote|Aleyz Ith'vayen takes your belt and reinforces it with a durable material.}}
{{Chat|Aleyz Ith'vayen|Here's your belt back.}}
<tabber>
|-|Enchanter=
{{ReceiveItem|You receive a [[Fine Cloth Belt of Runes]].}}
|-|Rogue=
{{ReceiveItem|You receive a [[Strengthened Leather Belt of Runes]].}}
</tabber>
{{Chat|Aleyz Ith'vayen|Let me know when you can assist me further.}}

=== Part 3 - Assassination - Req. Lvl 16 ===

{{Chat|say|I will assist you further|Deep Common}}
{{Emote|Aleyz Ith'vayen looks you up and down.}}
{{Chat|Aleyz Ith'vayen|You have made progress from when we first met. I will give you that.}}
{{Chat|Aleyz Ith'vayen|A glimmer of shadow surrounds you now, following your every movement.}}
{{Chat|Aleyz Ith'vayen|It is time to get your hands extremely bloody.}}
{{Chat|Aleyz Ith'vayen|We have been tasked with the assassination of an upstart exile.}}
{{Chat|Aleyz Ith'vayen|You will find him in the exile caves, far from our city center.}}
{{Chat|Aleyz Ith'vayen|Find the one called [[Jerek D'shadow]] and end his miserable life.}}
{{Chat|Aleyz Ith'vayen|Cut off his head and bring it to me as proof of the dead.}}
{{Chat|Aleyz Ith'vayen|Go now. Carve a swath of destruction through their ranks.}}
{{Chat|Aleyz Ith'vayen|Let them know that House Ith'vayen is not to be trifled with!}}
{{QuestNote|Go kill [[Jerek D'shadow]] and loot the [[Head of Jerek D'shadow]]. He can be found by going to the newbie quarry, going slightly up the ramp, dropping off, and crossing a bridge into a cave. Give the head to [[Aleyz Ith'vayen]].}}
{{Emote|Aleyz Ith'vayen places the severed head into a burlap sack by his desk.}}
{{Chat|Aleyz Ith'vayen|Fair work. Thank you.}}
{{exp}}
{{Faction|House Ith'vayen|+}}
{{Chat|Aleyz Ith'vayen|While you were out, I commissioned a magical scroll to reinforce your belt. Hand it to me and I will improve it.}}
{{QuestNote|Give [[Aleyz Ith'vayen]] your [[Fine Cloth Belt of Runes]] or [[Strengthened Leather Belt of Runes]].}}
{{Emote|Aleyz Ith'vayen takes your belt and the scroll in hand. As he reads quietly from the scroll, a glow surrounds your belt.}}
{{Chat|Aleyz Ith'vayen|Excellent. This should serve you well.}}
<tabber>
|-|Enchanter=
{{ReceiveItem|You receive a [[Silk Belt of Runes]].}}
|-|Rogue=
{{ReceiveItem|You receive a (item needs to be filled in) [[Unknown Belt of Runes]].}}
</tabber>
{{Chat|Aleyz Ith'vayen|Let me know when you can assist me further.}}

