== Walkthrough ==
{{QuestNote|Kalessa is located just inside the beginning of Blind Midden, opposite the room with [[Nibs Mudknuckle]]}}
{{Chat|say|Hail, Kalessa Velgarrith}}
{{Chat|Kalessa Velgarrith|Well met, [PlayerName]. Yes, [PlayerRace], your name is known.}}
{{Chat|Kalessa Velgarrith|Your purpose for coming to Blind Midden no longer matters, as you will soon learn.}}
{{Chat|Kalessa Velgarrith|I shall serve as your guide when you are ready for what comes next.}}
{{Chat|say|What comes next?}}
{{QuestInfo|Even at Amicable reputation, the following text is provided}}
{{Chat|Kalessa Velgarrith|All in good time, friend. For now, your time is best served proving loyalty to House Unheard.}}
{{Chat|Kalessa Velgarrith|You'll engage in the local industry, discovering the hidden gifts that can be found in our home.}}
{{Chat|Kalessa Velgarrith|For a small price, I'll provide you with the plans to build the tools used to build this place.}}
{{Chat|Kalessa Velgarrith|Bring me the fruits of your labor to strengthn our house. More lucrative work will follow.}}
{{QuestNote|Purchase the recipes for [[Charred Mudfish]], [[Shale Hilt]], and [[Crude Prison Shiv]] from [[Kalessa Velgarrith]]. The [[Mudfish]] can be acquired by using the MUD command "/take water" while standing next to any of the water in [[Blind Midden]] and then cooked into [[Charred Mudfish]]. The [[Sewer Sludge]], [[Crusted Midden Sludge]], or [[Black Midden Sludge]] that you also get can be handed into any slime for a chance at getting [[Shale Chunk]]s and [[Rusty Metal Shard]]s to make [[Crude Prison Shiv]]s. Hand them in to [[Kalessa Velgarrith]] one at a time.}}

