== Walkthrough ==

=== Part 1 - Feed the Runts ===
{{Chat|say|Hail, Handfed Bors.}}
{{Chat|Handfed Bors|Thought someone might come down. Two runts down the water, Cringette. They are not eating.}}
{{Chat|say|I will feed the runts.}}
{{Chat|Handfed Bors|Good. Someone your size can walk the low water into the den. I can't go back up that stone. Bring my two runts a treat from this pouch, and go slow so they know you.}}
{{QuestNote|Find [[a razorwing runt]] x2 and give them [[Bat Feed Cake]]. Despite the giant insisting they are "in the low water", they are deep underwater to the Northeast. Due to incredibly low visibility underwater, it is inadvisable to try to find the bats without the assistance of a tracker.}}
Return to ''Handfed Bors''.
{{exp}}
=== Part 2 - Cleanse the Lake ===
{{Chat|say|Hail, Handfed Bors.}}
{{Chat|Handfed Bors|Quiet feet, quiet hands. Both of them ate. Enough of that, there's more. Rest your legs on the stone a bit. Then we talk about the green lake in the den.}}
{{Chat|say|What's this about a green lake in the den?}}
{{Chat|Handfed Bors|Take this jar. Feed cake, gone to mold, spores off the top.}}
{{Chat|Handfed Bors|Down past the pens, where the water sits green. Pour the whole jar in. The mold chokes the green bloom.}}
{{QuestNote|Do not enter the water. It has no water physics. Do not enter the water. It has no water physics. Do not enter the water. It has no water physics. Do not enter the water. It has no water physics. Honestly, do not even get close to the water. It is bugged. You will fall in and die because it is horribly, horribly bugged. You will then have to petition to get your corpse out. Please update this page if the water is fixed to have water physics. Bugged as of Oct. 16, 2026.}}
''The following is conjecture since the quest is currently impossible to complete due to the bugged water physics in the lake.''
{{QuestNote|Travel Southwest into the caves with some form of invisibility and find the bright green glowing lake. The bats are KoS and killing them will negatively affect both your giant and bat faction, which may potentially be fixed later. Place the jar on your cursor and type ''/pour lake''.}}

