== Walkthrough ==

{{QuestNote|Find [[Nibs Mudknuckle]] in [[Blind Midden]]. If you enter from the main entrance, proceed to the second room of the dungeon, face to the right, his room is on the left opposite [[Kalessa Velgarrith]]. You must speak in <i>Common</i>, not Deep Common.}}
{{Chat|say|Hail, Nibs Mudknuckle.}}
{{Chat|Nibs Mudknuckle|Welcome home, [PlayerRace].}}
{{Chat|Nibs Mudknuckle|Your fate is sealed. For your sake, I hope your lips are as well.}}
{{Chat|Nibs Mudknuckle|A quick look around the room will show you what happens to those who cannot manage to keep a secret.}}
{{Chat|say|I can keep a secret.}}
{{Chat|Nibs Mudknuckle|I'll give you an ounce of trust because I've been cursed with a generous soul. It's my only weakness. Betray me once, and you'll taste my strength.}}
{{Chat|Nibs Mudknuckle|I am a collector, of sorts. A coin collector, to be specific.}}
{{Chat|Nibs Mudknuckle|To be more specific, I collect Blind Midden Marks of Merit.}}
{{Chat|Nibs Mudknuckle|Speak to me when you have marks to spend.}}
{{QuestNote|You can purchase [[The Midden Mark Menu]] from him for 1c to get vague hints about what he rewards you with for a certain number of coins.}}
<br>
{{QuestNote|If you hand in one [[Blind Midden Mark of Merit]]:}}
{{Chat|Nibs Mudknuckle|Here you are, [PlayerName]. A fistful of the Midden's finest. Enjoy it in good health.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Sewer Sludge]] from [[Nibs Mudknuckle]].}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Sewer Sludge]] from [[Nibs Mudknuckle]].}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Sewer Sludge]] from [[Nibs Mudknuckle]].}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Sewer Sludge]] from [[Nibs Mudknuckle]].}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Sewer Sludge]] from [[Nibs Mudknuckle]].}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Sewer Sludge]] from [[Nibs Mudknuckle]].}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Sewer Sludge]] from [[Nibs Mudknuckle]].}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Sewer Sludge]] from [[Nibs Mudknuckle]].}}
{{faction|Midden Underground Dregs|+}}
<br>
{{QuestNote|If you hand in five [[Blind Midden Mark of Merit]]:}}
{{Chat|Nibs Mudknuckle|I'll be honest, [PlayerName]. Most folks just use these to improve their skill and then throw away the creation.}}
{{Chat|Nibs Mudknuckle|There, I said it.}}
{{Chat|Nibs Mudknuckle|I would make a terrible salesman...}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive (randomly, one of: [[Pilfered Plans]], [[Shaper's Scribblings]], [[Sightless Seer's Stash]], [[Snitch Stabber's Stash]], [[Waterlogged Wand]]) from [[Nibs Mudknuckle]].}}
{{faction|Midden Underground Dregs|+}}
{{QuestNote|The various notes give you clues about where to obtain items. It seems you can only receive each item once and the note will be consumed on receipt of the item.}}

<tabber>
|-|Pilfered Plans=
{{QuestNote|Go to the spawn point of [[Wikket Two-Wands]]. Use the MUD command "/inspect bucket"}}
{{Emote|The tip of a soggy scroll pokes out of the almost-full bucket. You wish the Midden's sewer illusion applied to the bucket's contents.}}
{{QuestNote|Use the MUD command "/take scroll"}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Recipe: Mudfish Wraps]].}}
<b>OR</b>
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Recipe: Prison Gruel]].}}

|-|Shaper's Scribblings=
{{QuestNote|Near the spawn point of [[Cedrius the Cutter]] there's a workbench. Use the MUD command "/look"}}
{{Emote|You look through a drawer full of parchment. One looks legible.}}
{{QuestNote|Use the MUD command "/take scroll"}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Recipe: Shale Weightstone]].}}

|-|Sightless Seer's Stash=
{{QuestNote|To the player's right of [[Blurgh the Blind]] are two crates. Stand beside them and use the MUD command "/look"}}
{{Emote|The crate's lid is loose and slightly shifted, revealing a pile of scrolls. You think you can take one without the goblin noticing.}}
{{QuestNote|Use the MUD command "/take scroll"}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Recipe: Sewer Survival Salve]].}}
<b>OR</b>
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Recipe: Blind Midden Barrier]].}}

|-|Snitch Stabber's Stash=
{{QuestNote|Outside the spawn point of [[Mucky Morgurah]], near where [[Gorgeous]] spawns, is a barrel and a crate. Use the MUD command "/look"}}
{{Emote|Morgurah's barrel has a false bottom. Wrapped in rags is a scroll rolled tightly around an informant's tongue.}}
{{QuestNote|Use the MUD command "/take scroll"}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Recipe: Morgurah's Mask of the Stifled Snitch]].}}
<b>OR</b>
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Recipe: Double-Bladed Retractable Prison Shiv]].}}

|-|Waterlogged Wand=
{{QuestNote|Go to the spawn point of [[Reviver Vlarek]]. In the water near him is a cage. Go to the front of the cage and use the MUD command "/look". }}
{{Emote|The wand smuggler seems to have hastily hidden a wax-sealed scroll under the base of the cage.}}
{{QuestNote|Use the MUD command "/take scroll"}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Recipe: Boots of the Sewer Sifter]].}}
