== Overview ==

For a full set of Scarab Armor (including shield), you will need:

* 9 x [[Scarab Carapace]]
* 9 x [[Scarab Leg]]
* 1 x [[Scarab Thorax Plate]]
* 1 x [[Scarab Elytron Plate]]

== Walkthrough ==

{{QuestNote|[[Hult Beetlewrangler]] is located in the rear of the Sojourner Camp in [[Night Harbor]]. He can wander a short distance from his tent throughout the day.}}
{{Chat|say|Hail, Hult Beetlewrangler.}}
{{Chat|Hult Beetlewrangler|Woah, ho there, adventurer. Ya lookin for work or wares? No matter, ol' Hult's got somethin for ya either way.}}
{{Chat|say|I am looking for wares.}}
{{Chat|Hult Beetlewrangler|Well, well... maybe Hult's got the things ya need. Nanny Shrew always said, 'Hult, of all the Shrewfolk, ya've got to be the most industrious an' entrepreneurial of the lot... and most handsome too.}}
{{Chat|Hult Beetlewrangler|Well maybe not that last past anyway. Maybe not any of it.}}
{{Chat|Hult Beetlewrangler|Anyhow, ya musn't leave town in just yer drawers. How would ya like ol' Hult to make ya some fine accessories?}}
{{Chat|say|I would like you to make me some fine accessories.}}
{{Chat|Hult Beetlewrangler|Them ugly green scarabs out there in the dunes have mighty tough shells, they do. I can make ya a breastplate, greaves, helm, boots, and shield. Just ask ol' Hult how.}}

