{{QuestNote|Hunt [[a dunes scarab]] and loot 3 x [[Scarab Carapace]], 3 x [[Scarab Leg]], and 1 x [[Scarab Thorax Plate]].}}
{{QuestNote|Hand these items to [[Hult Beetlewrangler]].}}
{{exp}}
