|Related NPCs       = [[an escaped minion]]
|Quest Rewards      = [[Bloodied Bone]]
}}

{{QuestInfo|This quest is repeatable.}}

== Walkthrough ==
{{QuestNote|All classes are able to complete this quest, but only NEC / SHD can use the [[Bloodied Bone]].}}
{{QuestNote|[[Everett Graves]] is located in the Necropolis of [[Night Harbor]]. Everett is in the main room just as one enters the Concourse of Souls.}}
{{Chat|say|Hail, Everett Graves.}}
{{Chat|Everett Graves|Welcome to the Concourse of Souls. Are you a believer?}}
{{Chat|say|Yes.}}
{{Chat|Everett Graves|Then you shall serve, acolyte. I need your assistance with an investigation. One of our new apprentices has gone missing, but his undead servant was seen wandering near the excavation site, just outside the Western Gate.}}
{{Chat|Everett Graves|I want you to find and destroy it. Bring back any evidence that you discover.}}
{{QuestNote|Head to the [[Tomb of the Last Wyrmsbane]] and locate [[an escaped minion]]. The minion spawns within a room near the main entrance of the dungeon that contains several upright and open tombs which are embedded in the walls.}}
{{QuestNote|A good way to know if you are near the right room is to look for a cracked wall with a hole in it. This wall is just outside the room in which the quest NPC can be found in.}}
{{QuestInfo|[[an escaped minion]] DOES have a placeholder.}}
{{QuestNote|When you've located [[an escaped minion]], kill it and loot [[Bloodied Human Head]].}}
{{QuestNote|Return to [[Everett Graves]] in [[Night Harbor]] and give him the [[Bloodied Human Head]].}}
{{Chat|Everett Graves|That poor sap. I told him to summon weak minions until he learned to control them. What hubris he showed, trying to charm the dead so young.}}
{{Emote|Everett Graves pulls a bloodied bone from Ayvin's brain matter.}}
{{Chat|Everett Graves|Take this. It was enough to kill Ayvin, so it might prove some use against your enemies.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Bloodied Bone]] from Everett Graves.}}
{{exp}}
{{QuestInfo|Do you get any faction changes?}}

