Six Eyes Too Many.content:
{{Quest
| imagefilename     = Polietta two-tone.png
| width             = 300px
| caption           = Polietta Two-Tone
|Start Zone         = [[Evershade Weald]]
|Quest Giver        = [[Polietta Two-tone]]
|Minimum Level      = 1
|Classes            = All
|Related NPCs       = [[a black widow]]; [[an elder widow]]
|Quest Rewards      = [[Pixie Glitter]]; (exp);
}}

* Faction with [[Court of Summer]]

{{QuestInfo|This quest is repeatable.}}

== Walkthrough ==

{{QuestNote|Locate [[Polietta Two-tone]], who spawns in [[Evershade Weald]] during the day up on the hill near the Fae Guardians.}}
{{Chat|say|Hail, Polietta Two-tone.}}
{{Chat|Polietta Two-tone|Warm days to you, large-large one! What brings you-you to the toadstool of Polietta? Are you seeking some pixie-pixie glitter, yes-yes?}}
{{Chat|say|Pixie-pixie glitter?}}
{{Chat|Polietta Two-tone|Yes-yes! Polietta does have-have much glitter to spare, if one is willing-willing to perform for her a simple favor-favor!}}
{{Chat|say|You say, "What favor-favor?}}
{{Chat|Polietta Two-tone|The large-large one has seen the many-many-eyed ones skittering up and down the tree-trees of late, yes-yes?}}
{{Chat|Polietta Two-tone|''Widows'' I hear-hear them being called, yet Polietta has never-never seen a single husband. The eyes, though! Polietta has-has seen the eyes.}}
{{Chat|Polietta Two-tone|Eight eyes is simply too-too many, I say-say! Proper tings have two-two eyes, one-by-one and not four-by-four!}}
{{Chat|Polietta Two-tone|You'll bring-bring back to Polietta six of these eye-eyes, so that they're properly down to two-two like things should be-be!}}
{{Chat|Polietta Two-tone|Six eyes for glitter-glitter is a fair and good trade-trade. No more, no less-less. No hatchling eyes, either! The bigger-bigger ones are best.}}
{{QuestNote|Hunt [[a black widow]] and [[an elder widow]] until you have collected 6 x [[Widow Eye]].}}
{{QuestNote|Hand 6 x [[Widow Eye]] to [[Polietta Two-tone]].}}
{{exp}}
{{Faction|Court of Summer|+}}
{{Faction|Court of Winter|-}}
{{Chat|Polietta Two-tone|Oh, how lovely-lovely! Eight eyes down to two-two, just how things should be-be.}}
{{Chat|Polietta Two-tone|Many thanks-thanks for your favor, large-large one. Here's some of Polietta's famed glitter-glitter!}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Pixie Glitter]] from Polietta Two-tone.}}
{{QuestInfo|[[Pixie Glitter]] is used for [[Bard Starter Quest (Faelindral)]].}}

