Viper's Kick Recipe.content:
{{HasQuickGuide}}
{{Quest
| imagefilename     = Layla Faraj.png
| width             = 175px
|Start Zone         = [[Glass Flats]]
|Quest Giver        = [[Layla Faraj]]
|Minimum Level      = 20+
|Classes            = ALL
|Related NPCs       = [[Layla Faraj]], [[a Szuurian viper]], [[Nerida Thinblade]]
|Quest Rewards      = [[Viper's Kick]]; (exp);
}}

* Faction increase with [[Citizens of Night Harbor]]
{{QuestInfo|2 x [[Viper's Kick]] are used in the quest [[A Sweet Treat]].}}

== Walkthrough ==
{{QuestNote|Head to [[Layla Faraj]] in [[Glass Flats]]. Layla is located at the Pyrmos Mercenary / Salt Gatherer camp near the [[Sungreet Strand]] zoneline.}}
{{Chat|say|Hail, Layla Faraj.}}
{{Chat|Layla Faraj|Sweltering days and frigid nights here in the flats, my friend. I'm fortunate that the salt gatherers have spared me a tent in exchange for my services.}}
{{Chat|say|What services?}}
{{Chat|Layla Faraj|I'm a Sojourner of the Crow Clan and an alchemist by trade. I've been able to provide various tinctures and poultices to the workers while I remain here. Though admittedly, they seem to favor my Viper's Kick more than anything!}}
{{Chat|say|What is Viper's Kick?}}
{{Chat|Layla Faraj|Viper's Kick is the name I've given to a potent shot of liquor I produce using just enough viper toxin as to not be... fatal.}}
{{Chat|Layla Faraj|It gives you a swift kick in the mouth before making it go numb from the toxin's effects.}}
{{Chat|Layla Faraj|If you care to try it, I can make you a shot with some Black Feather whiskey and a Szuurian viper venom sac.}}
{{QuestNote|Kill [[a Szuurian viper]] and loot [[Szuurian Viper Venom Sac]].}}
{{QuestNote|Travel to Night Harbor and find [[Nerida Thinblade]] at The Spirit Tap bar in the Black Feather Bazaar. Purchase [[Black Feather Whiskey]] for 2 silver pieces.}}
{{QuestNote|Give 1 x [[Szuurian Viper Venom Sac]] and 1 x [[Black Feather Whiskey]] to [[Layla Faraj]].}}
{{Chat|Layla Faraj|Oh, perfect! Just a moment...}}
{{Emote|Layla Faraj carefully extracts just enough venom as to not be dangerous, depositing it into the whiskey and giving it a swift stir.}}
{{Chat|Layla Faraj|Here you are! This is sure to keep you warm on a cool night in the flats.}}
{{ReceiveItem|You receive [[Viper's Kick]] from Layla Faraj.}}
{{exp}}
{{Faction|Citizens of Night Harbor|+}}

