== Walkthrough ==

{{QuestInfo|Need all dialogues as well as more information on the fights themselves, how the turn-ins work, etc.}}

=== Details ===
{{QuestNote|In order to reach the arena, the only known way is to loot a [[Gilded Claw Compound Key]] through killing any of the claw members at the compound.}}
{{QuestNote|The entrance to the arena is behind the compound in the image above to the left, down a ramp to a locked door.}}
{{QuestNote|Once in the locked door there will be patrols that are aligned with the Claws roaming the halls.}}
{{QuestNote|In the locked door, there is a room to the right with an oddly colored wall that can be walked through.}}
{{QuestNote|It is safe to explore this area as all the NPCs are on the claw faction, aside from the slaves.}}
{{QuestNote|In order to start the arena you need to be <u>AMICABLE</u> to [[The Gilded Claws]]. This can be accomplished by killing many of the smuggler and bandits in the desert region. This includes smugglers in [[Fallen Pass]], [[Shaded Dunes]], and [[Sungreet Strand]].}}

=== Arena Notes ===

{{QuestNote|Shortly after a fight is started [[Ringmaster Vorn]] typically despawns with a 50 minute respawn timer.}}
{{QuestNote|When handed a note to spawn an encounter, Vorn stays available for a little while, making it possible to hand in multiple notes.}}
{{QuestNote|If you are on the same tier of fight, the encounter needs to be defeated before the next person can spawn the same encounter.}}
{{QuestNote|Different tiers can be started at the same time, be sure to have the correct person loot the proof of kill.}}

