{{NeedsInfo}}
{{Quest
| imagefilename     = phicon.png
| width             = 100px
| caption           = Placeholder Image
|Start Zone         = [[Blind Midden]]
|Quest Giver        = [[Chaplain Cranely]]
|Minimum Level      = 1
|Classes            = 
|Related NPCs       = [[Chaplain Cranely]]
}}

== Walkthrough ==

{{QuestNote|[[Chaplain Cranely]] is located on the top floor of [[Blind Midden]] in the sewers are where the gelmothers are at an altar. It is critical that you speak Common, not Deep Common.}}
{{Chat|say|Hail, Chaplain Cranely.|Common}}
{{Chat|Chaplain Cranely|Ahh, a new inmate. Welcome to the Midden, friend. Be of good cheer!}}
{{Chat|Chaplain Cranely|Whatever deed landed you here, rest assured, it can be forgiven... provided you know powerful enough people, of course.}}
{{Chat|Chaplain Cranely|Now if you will kindly forgive me, I must continue my research.}}
{{Chat|say|What research?|Common}}
{{Chat|Chaplain Cranely|This was once a sanctuary. A beacon of light in the smother darkness. And by light, I mean more of a "dim". Just enough to make a shadow, really.}}
{{Chat|Chaplain Cranely|Of late though, that dim has been snuffed out as a curse has taken hold. One I've not been able to make heads or brain stems of.}}
{{Chat|say|What curse?|Common}}
{{Chat|Chaplain Cranely|Since you ask, yes. A curse I must work tirelessly to lift.}}
{{Chat|Chaplain Cranely|The offering box on the altar was donated as a gift to inmates in the depth of despair.}}
{{Chat|Chaplain Cranely|The gift allowed those who have lost all hope to make whatever deep personal sacrifice they can muster in hopes that it will be looked upon as an acceptable bribe.}}
{{Chat|Chaplain Cranely|Now, however, offerings are consumed by an unseen force.}}
{{QuestNote|New quest update after 10/15 patch}}
{{Chat|say|What offering box?|Common}}
{{Chat|Chaplain Cranely|My research is still in progress, but I have discovered that acceptable offerings can be combined in the box with sewer sludge.}}
{{Chat|Chaplain Cranely|The result, when blessed by one with proper authority, such as myself, brings about a variety of inexplicable events.}}
{{Chat|Chaplain Cranely|I must study these events carefully. I have faith that this mystery will be solved in time.}}
{{Chat|Chaplain Cranely|Experiment with combinations and deliver me the results to help facilitate my investigation.}}

{{QuestNote|Clicking on the offering box opens a crafting window; mix in the offering box 1 [[Sewer Sludge]] and 1 [[Enchanted effigy]] and receive [[Sludge-Packed Effigy]]}}
{{QuestNote|hand in the sludge-packed effigy to Chaplain Cranely}}
{{Chat|Chaplain Cranely|The effigy within this mess would ounce have earned an inmate some... special privileges. But now, the prison itself consumes it.}}
{{Chat|Chaplain Cranely|Behold!}}
{{Chat|Chaplain Cranely|You see?! Hurry, deal with this horror. I must... uhh... record my findings.}}
 10/27/2026 the four skeles and the floating skull spawned, but after killing them, the Grave Hulk did not spawn? (10/27 3pm pacific just did and got the shield, I have had hulk spawn about 5 out of 9 times)
{{QuestNote|5 adds a mix of skeletons and floating skull spawn. Kill them then Grave Hulk spawns he drops Skeletal Champion's Shoulderguards or effigy warrior's shiv or Barrow iron tower shield}}

