{{Chat|Quilla Dorn|Don't touch the Myconids, and take nothing from the colony itself.}}


{{QuestNote|Go out and slay [[a mold beetle]] to obtain four [[Beetle-Chewed Fungal Growth]]. They can be found nearby in a cave, on an island, or on the other side of the small tunnel.}}
{{Emote|Quilla Dorn sets each piece of damaged growth on the sample racks and counts them.}}
{{Chat|Quilla Dorn|Four. That's the survey done, [PlayerName].}}
{{Chat|Quilla Dorn|I can offer protection against disease, or fungal materials. Your choice.}}

