Slay Skarr'Vokk.content:
{{NeedsInfo}}
{{Quest
| imagefilename     = Mobimage-wardennehma.png
| width             = 500px
| caption           = Quest courtesy of Almond
|Start Zone         = [[Caves of Irem]]
|Quest Giver        = [[Warden Neh'Ma]]
|Minimum Level      = 30
|Classes            = 
|Related NPCs       = [[Skarr'Vokk]]
}}


== Walkthrough ==
{{QuestNote|Find Warden Neh'Ma near the inverted waterfall.}}

{{Chat|say|Hail, Warden Neh'Ma.|Common Tongue}}
{{Chat|Warden Neh'Ma|Easy, big one.  Step slow.  We have had our fill of teeth in the dark.}}
{{Chat|Warden Neh'Ma|You do not wear the black fur of the Swarm.  Good. Speak, then, if you come in peace.}}
{{Chat|say|What swarm?|Common Tongue}}
{{Chat|Warden Neh'Ma|The Swarm was our own blood, once.  The dark water twisted them, and now they eat what they used to be.}}
{{Chat|Warden Neh'Ma|Each night they creep nearer from the banks.  They take our young for their cages.  We cannot hold much longer.}}
{{Chat|say|What dark water?|Common Tongue}}
{{Chat|Warden Neh'Ma|The Font is the heart of us.  Her the living water rises where all other water falls.}}
{{Chat|Warden Neh'Ma|So long as it flows the colony breaths. Should it die, we die with it.}}
{{Chat|say|I will help.|Common Tongue}}
{{Chat|Warden Neh'Ma|You wish to help?  Words are cheap, big one.  The Swarm listens only to blood.}}
{{Chat|Warden Neh'Ma|One of them leads the push on us, a vanguard called Skarr'Vokk.  Bring me proof that he is dead, and I will trust you.}}
Hand in Tail of Skarr'Vokk
{{Chat|Warden Neh'Ma|So. The one who called the Swarm forward calls no more. You have done my people a great kindness.}}
{{Chat|Warden Neh'Ma|Take this. My own hands knotted it. It warded my mother, and now it wards you.}}
{{Chat|Warden Neh'Ma|And carry this token, a sign to my people that you are counted as a friend.}}
{{Chat|Warden Neh'Ma|The banks breathe easier tonight. But the deep water holds and older fear. Come back when you are ready to hear of it.}}
{{Chat|say|Deep water?|Common Tongue}}
{{Chat|Warden Neh'Ma|The Font is the heart of us. Here the living water rises where all other water falls.}}
{{Chat|Warden Neh'Ma|So long as it flows, the colony breathes. Should it die, we die with it.}}

No further responses gathered from here.

Reward is a 1 STA Ring and a Faction Ring with unknown purpose. Skarr'Vokk drops a 2ac +5sta +3wis +1sv poison necklace all/all

''More information is needed...''

