== Walkthrough ==
{{QuestNote|Find Warden Neh'Ma near the inverted waterfall.}}

{{Chat|say|Hail, Warden Neh'Ma.|Common Tongue}}
{{Chat|Warden Neh'Ma|Easy, big one.  Step slow.  We have had our fill of teeth in the dark.}}
{{Chat|Warden Neh'Ma|You do not wear the black fur of the Swarm.  Good. Speak, then, if you come in peace.}}
{{QuestNote|Give Warden Neh'Ma a [[Riverwork Charm]].}}
{{Emote|Warden Neh'Ma turns the charm in her paws, then counts the knots with one claw.}}
{{Chat|Warden Neh'Ma|My sister tied this.  The swarm took her from the banks.  One of them was carrying it when you found it.}}
{{Chat|Warden Neh'Ma|Sit a while, big one.  Ask what you will of my people, and I will answer.}}
{{Chat|say|Tell me of your people.|Common Tongue}}
{{Chat|Warden Neh'Ma|We are the Mur'Hua, the folk of the living water. We swim, we trade, we make small beautiful things.}}
{{Chat|Warden Neh'Ma|Once we were many.  Now we hold these few islands and count our dead by the water.}}

